More machine, more human work </h3>
<p>Today, we=E2=80=99re releasing a new episode of our podcast, <em><u><a h=
ref=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce=
687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiQWZ0ZXIg4oCYQWZ0ZXIgQXV0b21hdGlv=
