rget=3D"_blank">AI &amp; I</a></u></em>. In a format flip, <strong><u><a hr=
ef=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce6=
87adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiQWZ0ZXIg4oCYQWZ0ZXIgQXV0b21hdGlvb=
uKAmSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQyNzYsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2=
ZXJ5LnRvL0BkYW5zaGlwcGVyIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjh9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" t=
arget=3D"_blank">Dan Shipper</a></u></strong> sits down with Every=E2=80=99=
s COO <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f8=
7698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiQWZ0ZXIg4oC=
YQWZ0ZXIgQXV0b21hdGlvbuKAmSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQyNzYsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLC=
J1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL0BicmFuZG9uXzUyNjMiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6OX0=3D" r=
el=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Brandon Gell</a></u></strong> =
not to interview a guest, but to be interviewed himself on why automating e=
verything leads to more human work. The occasion is <u><a href=3D"https://e=
very.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02=
e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiQWZ0ZXIg4oCYQWZ0ZXIgQXV0b21hdGlvbuKAmSIsInBvc3Rf=
aWQiOjQyNzYsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL2NoYWl=
uLW9mLXRob3VnaHQvYWZ0ZXItYXV0b21hdGlvbiIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjoxMH0=3D" rel=3D"noo=
pener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">=E2=80=9CAfter Automation,=E2=80=9D</a>=
</u> Dan=E2=80=99s 8,000-word argument on the topic that became our most vi=
ral piece of the year, <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f9545=
5f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiQW=
Z0ZXIg4oCYQWZ0ZXIgQXV0b21hdGlvbuKAmSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQyNzYsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6I=
nBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL3guY29tL2xlbm55c2FuL3N0YXR1cy8yMDU4OTg0MDg5OTU3=
NjU0NjIxIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjExfQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D=
"_blank">driving</a></u> the <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c=
3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0=
IjoiQWZ0ZXIg4oCYQWZ0ZXIgQXV0b21hdGlvbuKAmSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQyNzYsInBvc3RfdHl=
wZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL3guY29tL3BtYXJjYS9zdGF0dXMvMjA1ODY2NTI2Nj=
Y4NzcyNTgwMCIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjoxMn0=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D=
"_blank">AI discourse</a></u> on X for a couple days.</p>
<p>It=E2=80=99s a counterintuitive thesis from someone who runs a company t=
hat=E2=80=99s automated every single thing it can. And yet Every has grown =
from four people to 30 in the GPT era, with <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/=
emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e2=
42/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiQWZ0ZXIg4oCYQWZ0ZXIgQXV0b21hdGlvbuKAmSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQy=
NzYsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL3Avd2hhdC1pLWx=
lYXJuZWQtb25ib2FyZGluZy1vdXItYWktcHJvamVjdC1tYW5hZ2VyIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjEzfQ=
=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">agents embedded</a></=
u> into nearly every workflow. Dan=E2=80=99s point isn=E2=80=99t that AI wo=
n=E2=80=99t change work=E2=80=94it already has=E2=80=94but that it drives u=
p the demand for human expertise, judgment, and <u><a href=3D"https://every=
=2Eto/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f8769=
8e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e189=
66e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiQWZ0ZXIg4oCYQWZ0ZXIgQXV0b21hdGlvbuKAmSIsInBvc3RfaWQi=
