<p>It=E2=80=99s tempting to save Fable for the biggest, most heavy-duty job=
s you have. But there are more ways to measure complexity than the size of =
the task. Some jobs are hard because they demand enormous execution against=
 a settled plan. Others become hard when the model discovers that the goal,=
 baseline, or standard was wrong from the start. A smaller model may handle=
 the first surprisingly well. Fable=E2=80=99s advantage becomes clearest in=
 the second.</p>
<p>Anthropic member of technical staff <strong><u><a href=3D"https://icu.ev=
ery.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e65=
