0019f3d9737cf-f00b6987-8cc8-4cd4-ab79-3a857b396184-000000/2284sHWrnJLm7eDJW=
KwAqmRUdFsX2y_MUcE19JCLaKs=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_bl=
ank">Thariq Shihipar</a></u> </strong>offers a way to recognize this second=
 kind of difficulty before Fable spends time executing against the wrong pr=
emise. His <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Fem=
ails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966=
