93bnMiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6OX0=3D/1/0100019f3d9737cf-f00b6987-8cc8-4cd4-ab79-3a8=
57b396184-000000/Tn6kgjYizTZd7C9mPKPDk7YGQ1UnxNGx4LS1hekhEUU=3D452" rel=3D"=
noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">field guide</a></u> shows how to use=
 the model to surface questions and decisions that the assignment leaves un=
resolved, both before execution and as the work unfolds.</p>
<p>He frames the problem as a gap between the map and the territory. The ma=
p is the prompt, skills, and context you give Claude. The territory is the =
codebase, the real world, and the constraints that each introduces. Thariq =
calls the gaps between them =E2=80=9Cunknowns=E2=80=9D: moments when Claude=
 must make a decision without enough information to know what you would wan=
t. Picking up on a framework popularized by former United States Secretary =
of Defense <strong>Donald Rumsfeld</strong>, Shihipar differentiates betwee=
n =E2=80=9Cunknown knowns=E2=80=9D and <a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/=
https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619ea=
fce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVXNlIEZhYmxlIEJlZm9yZSBZb3U=
gS25vdyBXaGF0IHRvIEFzayIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQzMzAsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cm=
wiOiJodHRwczovL2VuLndpa2lwZWRpYS5vcmcvd2lraS9UaGVyZV9hcmVfdW5rbm93bl91bmtub=
3ducyIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjoxMH0=3D/1/0100019f3d9737cf-f00b6987-8cc8-4cd4-ab79-3a=
857b396184-000000/Li_6xCD84xqGdyLVttx8CXYo3UmwoCf_RpvJGz_c5YM=3D452" rel=3D=
"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">=E2=80=9C</a><u><a href=3D"https://=
icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87=
