XmXbg=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Mike Taylor</a><=
/u></strong> gave Fable the completed manuscript of his book about the AI p=
rogramming framework DSPy. His request had explicit boundaries: Read it and=
 tell him what he had missed. Yet it posed an unknown known. Mike expected =
to recognize a major omission if Fable surfaced one, even though he could n=
ot name it in advance. The difficult part was evaluation rather than execut=
ion. </p>
<p>Every CEO <strong><u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Feve=
ry.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebef=
cc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVXNlIEZhYmxlIEJlZm9yZSBZb3UgS25vdyBXaGF0IH=
