f3ahyWgB1L_o=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Dan Shipp=
er</a></u></strong> pointed Fable at five weeks of stalled copy-editing exp=
eriments and asked it to review the work and =E2=80=9Ccome to your own conc=
lusion.=E2=80=9D The model found an unknown unknown: Dan had set a goal of =
reproducing 70 percent of editor in chief <strong><u><a href=3D"https://icu=
.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698=
e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVXNlIEZhYmxlI=
EJlZm9yZSBZb3UgS25vdyBXaGF0IHRvIEFzayIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQzMzAsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6=
InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL0BrYXRlXzE3NjciLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MTR=
9/1/0100019f3d9737cf-f00b6987-8cc8-4cd4-ab79-3a857b396184-000000/MNGLuif6jS=
wciIxHU4X_CfsV9sqWjl3dt5ZGYPd2-MA=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=
=3D"_blank">Kate Lee</a></u></strong>=E2=80=99s historical edits before mea=
suring how often Kate herself would make the same edit twice. The team had =
spent five weeks improving performance against a target it had never valida=
ted. Fable=E2=80=99s useful contribution was finding fault in the assignmen=
t itself.</p>
<p>These examples expand the definition of a Fable-sized task. Mike=E2=80=
=99s hinged on an unnamed standard. Dan=E2=80=99s was an unquestioned premi=
se. Neither would look especially heavy-duty by scope alone.</p>
<p>Once every Fable request hits the meter, triage by uncertainty as well a=
s scale. Use a cheaper model when the goal, constraints, and definition of =
good are settled. Reach for Fable when the map is still incomplete.</p>
