Forget vague heuristics =
such as =E2=80=9CAI wrappers.=E2=80=9D Dan Pupius, chief technology officer=
 at The General Partnership, argues that founders need a more robust =
framework to understand the risks and opportunities of building with AI. He=
 encourages founders to look holistically at the implicit assumptions =
underneath their AI strategy, from the cost of intelligence, model =
self-sufficiency, platform lock-in, and the regulatory environment. I =
worked with Dan more than a decade ago at Medium, and the same quiet, =
thoughtful brilliance I knew him for then shines in his nuanced analysis.=
