THE FOUR BETS

We kept seeing a pattern with founders. A team would walk us=
 through their strategy. It would sound reasonable and exciting, but the =
more we looked, the more often these companies=E2=80=99 fates seemed to =
hinge on factors outside their control.

Those factors mapped to four axes =
of bets that startups were taking. The companies that understood this knew =
where the tailwinds and risks of building with AI were. Those that =
didn=E2=80=99t were exposed.

