b3cgV2hpY2ggT25lcz8gIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDMyNCwicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI=
6Imh0dHBzOi8vZXZlcnkudG8vcG9kY2FzdC9oZS1idWlsdC1hLWdwdC13cmFwcGVyLXRoYXQtaG=
FzLWhhbGYtYS1taWxsaW9uLXVzZXJzLWFuZC1rZWVwcy1ncm93aW5nIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjd9/=
1/0100019f197f77fc-7e38ae12-3145-4476-aa59-878b0c685637-000000/vhBke9dUOk1h=
ufqJs-VQPRVg41xKfRMTAsW46xU9gCc=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=
=3D"_blank">AI wrapper</a></u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F=
%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adc=
e5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiWW91ciBBSSBTdHJhdGVneSBJcyBNYWtpbmcg=
QmV0cy4gRG8gWW91IEtub3cgV2hpY2ggT25lcz8gIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDMyNCwicG9zdF90eXB=
lIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vZXZlcnkudG8vcG9kY2FzdC9oZS1idWlsdC1hLWdwdC=
13cmFwcGVyLXRoYXQtaGFzLWhhbGYtYS1taWxsaW9uLXVzZXJzLWFuZC1rZWVwcy1ncm93aW5nI=
iwicG9zaXRpb24iOjh9/1/0100019f197f77fc-7e38ae12-3145-4476-aa59-878b0c685637=
-000000/Ljo11SOcKhU0wOWFgkG7uqrq9Gby7-iP8TebYvPf1mI=3D452" rel=3D"noopener =
noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">=E2=80=9D</a> and toward the specific futures=
 a company is betting on. The goal is to recognize sooner when you=E2=80=99=
re wrong and move before the market forces you to=E2=80=94not to predict th=
e future more precisely.</p>
<h2 id=3D"the-four-bets"><strong>The four bets </strong></h2>
<p>We kept seeing a pattern with founders. A team would walk us through the=
ir strategy. It would sound reasonable and exciting, but the more we looked=
, the more often these companies=E2=80=99 fates seemed to hinge on factors =
outside their control. </p>
<p>Those factors mapped to four axes of bets that startups were taking. The=
 companies that understood this knew where the tailwinds and risks of build=
ing with AI were. Those that didn=E2=80=99t were exposed. </p>
