tting they won=E2=80=99t. Open-weight models could close the capability gap=
. A single AI failure with real harm could trigger a legislative response o=
vernight. You don=E2=80=99t need to predict which of these will happen, but=
 you need to know which ones are threats for your company, and what you=E2=
=80=99d do if they did.</p>
<h2 id=3D"articulate-your-bets"><strong>Articulate your bets</strong></h2>
<p>Your strategy is already making bets about these axes. The question is w=
hether you=E2=80=99ve written them down and made them explicit. </p>
<p>Having explicit bets creates internal alignment. Your team knows what yo=
u=E2=80=99re building toward and what would cause a pivot. They can make lo=
cal decisions that stay consistent with the overall direction because they =
understand the assumptions underneath. When the plan changes, they still kn=
ow where it=E2=80=99s headed.</p>
<p>Explicit bets enable faster adaptation. When signals shift, you recogniz=
e it sooner because you know what you were watching for. You=E2=80=99ve alr=
