<p>As any child who=E2=80=99s heard <strong>Aesop</strong> knows, the point=
 of a fable is its moral. We see the consequences of falsely crying wolf. W=
e learn why slow and steady wins the hare race.</p>
<p>So what is the moral of Claude Fable 5, Anthropic=E2=80=99s newest model=
, which this week we called <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2=
F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687ad=
ce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIE1vcmFsIG9mIEZhYmxlIiwicG9zdF9=
pZCI6NDMwMCwicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vZXZlcnkudG8vdmliZS=
