Y2UiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MzU1LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmV=
yeS50by92aWJlLWNoZWNrL29wdXMtNSIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjo3fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener =
noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Vibe Check</a> asks whether Opus 5 is disappo=
inting=E2=80=94or whether the workflows it broke have become part of the pr=
oblem. We tested it across coding, writing, knowledge work, and agents, wit=
h results that made the model hard to place.</p>
<p>Opus 5 doesn=E2=80=99t reach Fable=E2=80=99s ceiling, and it isn=E2=80=
=99t as easy to use day to day as GPT-5.6 Sol. Its best work may require re=
building systems that already work. The <a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/=
click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJz=
dWJqZWN0IjoiVmliZSBDaGVjazogQ2xhdWRlIE9wdXMgNSBJcyBCcmlsbGlhbnQgaW4gRmxhc2h=
lcywgRnJ1c3RyYXRpbmcgaW4gUHJhY3RpY2UiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MzU1LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOi=
Jwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by92aWJlLWNoZWNrL29wdXMtNSIsInBvc2l0a=
W9uIjo4fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">full review<=
/a> explains what we would change, where the model surprised us, and who sh=
ould bother making room for it.</p>
