  <div class=3D"post-body">
    <p>On Friday night, the U.S. government banned Anthropic=E2=80=99s dist=
ribution of Fable 5 and Mythos 5 to non-U.S. nationals. In response, Anthro=
pic disabled Fable for <em>all</em> customers. As of this writing, the situ=
ation is ongoing. </p>
<p>It remains to be seen how it will play out, but I can already see the di=
fference in my AI usage. Here=E2=80=99s a graph comparing my Claude and Cod=
ex usage before and after the ban (the =E2=80=9Cevent=E2=80=9D below):</p>
<div class=3D"quill-block-image" id=3D"quill-block-image-1781398787200" dat=
a-source=3D'{"dom_id":"quill-block-image-1781398787200","link":"https://d24=
ovhgu8s7341.cloudfront.net/uploads/editor/posts/4301/optimized_0412b932-1e9=
4-42ee-8720-c7a8f840ed2f.png","image":"https://d24ovhgu8s7341.cloudfront.ne=
t/uploads/editor/posts/4301/optimized_0412b932-1e94-42ee-8720-c7a8f840ed2f.=
png","caption":"Image courtesy of Dan Shipper.","error":null}'><div>
<a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2=
F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJ=
qZWN0IjoiRmFibGUsIERpc2FibGVkIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDMwMSwicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdC=
IsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vZDI0b3ZoZ3U4czczNDEuY2xvdWRmcm9udC5uZXQvdXBsb2Fkcy9lZ=
Gl0b3IvcG9zdHMvNDMwMS9vcHRpbWl6ZWRfMDQxMmI5MzItMWU5NC00MmVlLTg3MjAtYzdhOGY4=
NDBlZDJmLnBuZyIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjo1fQ=3D=3D/1/0100019ec5ff5667-04c21828-fc54-4=
0e7-be4d-309a164d1f93-000000/yLtn3kLtzgEQLCSaQboX2GYthaUjC_kA35cKi-B0hDI=3D=
452" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer"><img src=3D"https://d24o=
vhgu8s7341.cloudfront.net/uploads/editor/posts/4301/optimized_0412b932-1e94=
-42ee-8720-c7a8f840ed2f.png" alt=3D"Image courtesy of Dan Shipper." width=
=3D"600"></a><figcaption class=3D"quill-image-caption">Image courtesy of Da=
n Shipper.</figcaption>
</div></div>
<p><br></p>
<p>Before the ban, I was split about evenly between Claude and Codex. After=
 (and after a period where I was using neither because I was sleeping), I s=
