3. GROWTH IN AGENT-GENERATED ACTIVITY

Mike: You have a front-row seat to this new agent economy. You said =
publicly that you have had more pull requests submitted in a month than in =
all of last year. How are those stats exploding?

Kyle Daigle: We are =
seeing much more activity on GitHub. Last October at GitHub Universe, we =
