7. DIFFERENTIATING IN A COMPETITIVE MARKET

Mike: This is a very competitive market, and the pace of change is quick. =
How do you differentiate?

Kyle Daigle: We continue to focus on our roots: =
developer choice, building for builders, and enabling builders. We went =
from an era of many APIs and broad access into a somewhat unintentional =
walled-garden setup, where people develop an affinity for one tool and then=
 realize that trying something interesting elsewhere means learning a new =
tool or opening a new account.

We want developers building with GitHub to =
use other tools, and we will partner with everyone to make that as simple =
