MOST AI TOOLS STOP AT THE =
SUMMARY

Research is the easy part. The work is everything after: the =
report drafted, the spreadsheet updated, the recap posted in Slack, the =
follow-up actually sent. Grok Bot=E2=80=99s Bots do that part. Each one =
runs on its own cloud computer, signed in to your CRM, your ATS, your inbox=
, clicking and typing through the same software your team already uses. =
Give a Bot a job instead of a prompt, then check the result the way =
you=E2=80=99d check a coworker=E2=80=99s. Built by the team behind SpaceXAI=
.

