In addition to the main `spiral write` command, the CLI and MCP, or model =
context protocol, expose =E2=80=9Cpersonalize=E2=80=9D and =
=E2=80=9Chumanize=E2=80=9D functions. =E2=80=9CPersonalize=E2=80=9D takes a=
 given piece of text and rewrites it in your voice. =
=E2=80=9CHumanize=E2=80=9D does a pass to remove common AI tells, including=
 the dreaded em-dash https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e65=
