<p>It also now averages a 4.9/5 conversation score on our internal LLM-as-j=
udge eval.</p>
<p>We built Spiral to help people who write for work write better. Just as =
Cursor is a coding harness, Spiral is a writing harness, supporting you at =
every stage of the writing process. Here=E2=80=99s how:</p>
<ol>
<li>
