idea and materials to substantiate it. From basic writing prompts to the ha=
rd-won insights from Every=E2=80=99s editorial and social media teams, mult=
iple 12,000-word system prompts govern Spiral=E2=80=99s workflow. (To get t=
he style and substance just right, we=E2=80=99ve iterated on these system p=
rompts 131 times so far.)</li>
<li>
<strong>When it=E2=80=99s time to draft</strong>, Spiral uses stylometry to=
 reproduce your voice, working in Every=E2=80=99s know-how where appropriat=
e. For example, if you ask Spiral for tweets, it will incorporate best prac=
tices from X=E2=80=99s latest algorithm update. </li>
<li>
<strong>When you need help polishing a draft, </strong>Spiral is your edito=
r. Along with a built-in guardrails against AI-speak, you can set custom wr=
iting rules that Spiral applies in a =E2=80=9Ctop edit,=E2=80=9D the final =
expert-level edit on a piece=E2=80=94a term I learned working at Every.</li=
>
</ol>
<p>We=E2=80=99ve written about <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https=
:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce68=
