 rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Dan Shipper</a></u></strong>=
 has <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2=
Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2=
FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiU3BpcmFsIDQuMCBHb2VzIEFnZW50LW5hdGl2ZSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQyOD=
gsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL3d3dy55b3V0dWJlLmNvbS93YXRja=
