-2f9e-4634-a7db-239e2da96c5c-000000/R2nvI_k2G1pACYEYM7kx-zxtzC28vLV4yrEpBSH=
RftM=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">pointed out</a></=
u>, Claude and Codex are increasingly becoming the central interface for al=
l computer work. So we=E2=80=99ve made Spiral available to agents via MCP, =
CLI, and API.</p>
<p>To try it out, copy and paste this command in your agent:</p>
<blockquote><em>Help me set up Spiral, my AI writing tool, so you can write=
 in my voice. Read https://writewithspiral.com/agents.md and follow the ste=
ps. In short: add Spiral=E2=80=99s remote MCP server at https://api.writewi=
thspiral.com/mcp/ (Streamable HTTP). The first connection opens a browser t=
o sign in to Spiral and authorize access (OAuth, no API key to paste). Then=
 help me write something.</em></blockquote>
<p>The CLI, or command-line interface, is personally how I use Spiral the m=
ost. After I merge a pull request, a cleanup command runs in Claude Code, w=
hich calls Spiral to generate tweets about the new feature for the <u><a hr=
ef=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f=
95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0=
IjoiU3BpcmFsIDQuMCBHb2VzIEFnZW50LW5hdGl2ZSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQyODgsInBvc3RfdHl=
wZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL3guY29tL1RyeVNwaXJhbCIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjoxNX=
0=3D/1/0100019e93800578-9498c0c8-2f9e-4634-a7db-239e2da96c5c-000000/zwk4c5u=
iLcaERF2pkHzPv3LHojpFG0LRs7POSNaef1k=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" tar=
get=3D"_blank">Spiral X</a></u> account. Spiral markets itself. This techni=
que is now bundled into the <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2=
F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687ad=
ce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiU3BpcmFsIDQuMCBHb2VzIEFnZW50LW5hdGl=
2ZSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQyODgsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2dpdG=
h1Yi5jb20vZXZlcnlpbmMvY29tcG91bmQtZW5naW5lZXJpbmctcGx1Z2luIiwicG9zaXRpb24iO=
jE2fQ=3D=3D/1/0100019e93800578-9498c0c8-2f9e-4634-a7db-239e2da96c5c-000000/=
eqh1jwF-GgD4ocwH1XXWFWHOwYhqgGPwPLDXoQS9V1I=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferr=
er" target=3D"_blank">compound engineering plugin</a></u> in the form of th=
e `ce-promote` command.</p>
<p>In addition to the main `spiral write` command, the CLI and MCP, or mode=
l context protocol, expose =E2=80=9Cpersonalize=E2=80=9D and =E2=80=9Chuman=
ize=E2=80=9D functions. =E2=80=9CPersonalize=E2=80=9D takes a given piece o=
f text and rewrites it in your voice. =E2=80=9CHumanize=E2=80=9D does a pas=
s to remove common AI tells, including the dreaded <u><a href=3D"https://ic=
u.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f8769=
8e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiU3BpcmFsIDQu=
MCBHb2VzIEFnZW50LW5hdGl2ZSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQyODgsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ=
