 rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">AI &amp; I</a></em> episode =
with CEO <strong>Alex Rattray</strong>, who laid out the design principles =
for making software legible to agents months before the deal happened. Plus=
: We did a mini-<a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87=
