<h4 id=3D"alex-rattray-stainless-ceo-and-mcp-whisperer">Alex Rattray, Stain=
less CEO and MCP whisperer</h4>
<p>Flashy frontier <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05=
e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiR29vZ2=
