target=3D"_blank">acquired Stainless</a></u>, a software platform for high-=
quality APIs, to extend Claude=E2=80=99s ability to connect to data and too=
ls. (While terms weren=E2=80=99t disclosed, The Information put the purchas=
e price at north of <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f0=
5e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiR29vZ=
2xlIEkvTzogQWdlbnRzLCBBZ2VudHMsIEFnZW50cyIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQyNjksInBvc3RfdHlw=
