rer" target=3D"_blank">$300 million</a></u>.) Former Stainless customers in=
clude OpenAI and Google, meaning Anthropic has acquired a developer tooling=
 company used by its top rivals.</p>
<p>In October, Stainless CEO and founder <strong><u><a href=3D"https://ever=
