  <div class=3D"post-body">
      <p><em>Was this newsletter forwarded to you? <u><a href=3D"https://ic=
u.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f8769=
8e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSSBWaWJlIENv=
