ce of done-ness. </p>
<p>I had tested what I wanted Tastemaker to do: Connect to an agent. It con=
nected to an agent. But I didn=E2=80=99t test whether somebody who was not =
supposed to connect could do it anyway. I didn=E2=80=99t know that was the =
question. With the feature working, the unanswered questions felt less urge=
nt. Then they weren=E2=80=99t.</p>
