2UtYWkvIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjEwfQ=3D=3D. But knowledge workers account for =
about 20 percent of Codex users https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e=
60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiQ29kZXg=
