<h2 id=3D"our-codex-for-knowledge-work-guide-gets-an-upgrade"><strong>Our =
=E2=80=98Codex for Knowledge Work=E2=80=99 guide gets an upgrade</strong></=
h2>
<p>Codex has been on a tear lately. With new features like Sites and role-s=
pecific plugins, and high-concept video ads scattered across San Francisco,=
 OpenAI really wants you to know that Codex is not just for coders anymore.=
 </p>
<p>According to the company, they=E2=80=99re chasing promising early signal=
s. Codex has only 5 million weekly active users overall; for comparison, Ch=
atGPT has <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Fema=
