<h4 id=3D"cost-is-only-part-of-the-decision"><strong>Cost is only part of t=
he decision</strong></h4>
<p>Fable 5 is powerful=E2=80=94and expensive. The model is available on Cla=
ude=E2=80=99s paid plans until June 22, after which it will move to token-b=
ased pricing. (It costs $10 per million input tokens and $50 per million ou=
tput tokens, making it roughly two times the cost of Opus 4.8 and three tim=
es the cost of <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%=
2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e1=
8966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSG93IHRvIEdldCB0aGUgTW9zdCBPdXQgb2YgRmFibGUgNSIs=
InBvc3RfaWQiOjQyOTQsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnR=
