All it takes is one viral post to make you feel like you=E2=80=99re using =
AI all wrong. Someone=E2=80=99s running 12 Claude Code sessions in parallel=
. Someone else=E2=80=99s agent answers emails while they sleep. Meanwhile, =
you=E2=80=99re still arguing with ChatGPT.

Here=E2=80=99s the thing: =
Keeping up with the power users isn=E2=80=99t the point. The best way to =
get value from AI is to use it in a way that fits your work=E2=80=94and to =
check in now and then to see whether you could be getting more from it.

With that in mind, today we published a guide https://every.=
to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e1896=
