eferrer" target=3D"_blank">Sign up</a></u> to get it in your inbox.</em></p=
>
<p></p>
<hr class=3D"quill-line">
<p></p>
<p>All it takes is one viral post to make you feel like you=E2=80=99re usin=
g AI all wrong. Someone=E2=80=99s running 12 Claude Code sessions in parall=
el. Someone else=E2=80=99s agent answers emails while they sleep. Meanwhile=
, you=E2=80=99re still arguing with ChatGPT.</p>
<p>Here=E2=80=99s the thing: Keeping up with the power users isn=E2=80=99t =
the point. The best way to get value from AI is to use it in a way that fit=
s your work=E2=80=94and to check in now and then to see whether you could b=
e getting more from it. </p>
<p>With that in mind, today we published a <a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/=
CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c6=
19eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiV2hlcmUgRG8gWW91IEZhbGw=
gb24gdGhlIEVpZ2h0IExldmVscyBvZiBBSSBBZG9wdGlvbj8iLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0Mjg0LCJwb3=
N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9ndWlkZXMvdGhlLWVpZ2h0L=
WxldmVscy1vZi1haS1hZG9wdGlvbj9zb3VyY2U9cG9zdF9idXR0b24iLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6NX0=
=3D/1/0100019e8918c8e0-8cd8e637-aeb7-4ef9-ac14-217b4bdc5790-000000/X8rGc-hk=
33CK19ZTOa2h0iXfXH7h1xuZEyRUv5j93Ig=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" targ=
et=3D"_blank">guide</a> that maps all eight levels of AI adoption, from cha=
tbot basics to full agent orchestration. We explain how each level works in=
 practice, with sample prompts, so you can figure out which ones match your=
 current needs and workflows, what=E2=80=99s possible at each stage, and wh=
en it=E2=80=99s time to move to the next one. </p>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Level 1=E2=80=94Chatbot: </strong>You ask, it answers.</li>
<li>
<strong>Level 2=E2=80=94Copilot:</strong> The AI works alongside you, insid=
e your files.</li>
<li>
<strong>Level 3=E2=80=94Agent:</strong> It executes a task step by step, ch=
ecking in for approval.</li>
<li>
<strong>Level 4=E2=80=94Autopilot:</strong> It runs on its own; you review =
the result.</li>
<li>
<strong>Level 5=E2=80=94Workflows:</strong> You build a system that makes i=
ts output more reliable.</li>
<li>
<strong>Level 6=E2=80=94Assistant: </strong>It works in the background, wit=
hout being prompted.</li>
<li>
<strong>Level 7=E2=80=94Multi-agent:</strong> You manage several long-runni=
ng agents at once.</li>
<li>
