GVpcGV0ZS9zdGF0dXMvMjAxNDEyMzA4NjgxNjE5ODcxMT9zPTIwIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjE1fQ=
=3D=3D that this Claude-Code-plus-cron-job setup is the same as OpenClaw.


WHERE OPENCLAW FALLS SHORT

We=E2=80=99ve established that OpenClaw and =
Claude Code can do many of the same things. So why do I steer people toward=
 Claude Code? A few reasons.

Let me give credit where it=E2=80=99s due: =
OpenClaw showed the world something important and earned every one of its =
380,000 GitHub stars https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e65=
