19f0478fe27-57a47ec2-4652-4312-8baf-34a1777c3fc0-000000/plggc8ql2-dGOyrLzEn=
XCq8cpWh8cR_X1VlT_DVQ-RE=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blan=
k">OpenClaw</a></u> showed the world what an AI assistant could look like. =
</p>
<p>The open-source project became the most-starred software project in hist=
ory in only <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Fe=
mails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e1896=
6e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiQ2xhdWRlIENvZGUgSXMgdGhlIE9wZW5DbGF3IEFsdGVybmF0aXZ=
lIFlvdSBBbHJlYWR5IEhhdmUiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MzIxLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidX=
JsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldS4zNmtyLmNvbS9lbi9wLzM3MDY1MzQzMTE1NzE4NDMiLCJwb3NpdGlvb=
iI6N30=3D/1/0100019f0478fe27-57a47ec2-4652-4312-8baf-34a1777c3fc0-000000/tb=
StxcCCZX34O2tlX2cF_lUhJ1kym4IzJ3yhqv8p6Mc=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer=
" target=3D"_blank">60 days</a></u>, not because of hype. People were exper=
iencing AI that didn=E2=80=99t just answer questions but <em>did things</em=
>. Managed your calendar. Sent emails. Controlled your browser. All trigger=
ed from a text message in WhatsApp or Slack.</p>
<p>I watched <strong>Sam Altman</strong> hire OpenClaw=E2=80=99s creator an=
d Microsoft CEO <strong>Satya Nadella</strong> build =E2=80=9CClawPilot=E2=
=80=9D on top of the framework. And the whole time, one thought kept naggin=
g at me: Claude Code already does all of this. What=E2=80=99s so special ab=
out the crustaceans? </p>
<p>The answer was rooted in public perception. OpenClaw was marketed as an =
AI agent, and Claude Code was marketed as a coding tool. </p>
<p>We=E2=80=99ve now spent months building on both Claude Code and OpenClaw=
 at Every=E2=80=94including <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2=
F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687ad=
ce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiQ2xhdWRlIENvZGUgSXMgdGhlIE9wZW5DbGF=
3IEFsdGVybmF0aXZlIFlvdSBBbHJlYWR5IEhhdmUiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MzIxLCJwb3N0X3R5cG=
UiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9wb2RjYXN0L2V2ZXJ5cy1oZWFkLW9mL=
WNvbnN1bHRpbmctanVzdC1hdXRvbWF0ZWQtaGVyLWpvYiIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjo4fQ=3D=3D/1/0=
100019f0478fe27-57a47ec2-4652-4312-8baf-34a1777c3fc0-000000/aBWuC2pLirYGciP=
wYnREHCKLFum6UagxI8ncNsY6uM8=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_=
blank">Claudie</a></u>, an AI employee who runs our consulting team=E2=80=
=99s back office. That work has shown us why initial excitement about <u><a=
 href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7=
c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZ=
WN0IjoiQ2xhdWRlIENvZGUgSXMgdGhlIE9wZW5DbGF3IEFsdGVybmF0aXZlIFlvdSBBbHJlYWR5=
IEhhdmUiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MzIxLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9=
ldmVyeS50by9zb3VyY2UtY29kZS93ZS1nYXZlLWV2ZXJ5LWVtcGxveWVlLWFuLWFpLWFnZW50LW=
hlcmUtcy13aGF0LXdlLXJlLWRvaW5nLWRpZmZlcmVudGx5LW5vdyIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjo5fQ=3D=
=3D/1/0100019f0478fe27-57a47ec2-4652-4312-8baf-34a1777c3fc0-000000/WQcZPVmO=
XLhh7z6xDlzKG9WexNtXvvx8eRO1wxQywtQ=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" targ=
et=3D"_blank">OpenClaw is cooling</a></u>=E2=80=94linked to its unreliabili=
ty=E2=80=94and why Claude Code is the most capable platform for building an=
 AI assistant today. </p>
<p>If you=E2=80=99re trying to build an AI that does things, you don=E2=80=
=99t need to wait for a better OpenClaw alternative because you already hav=
e one. Here=E2=80=99s the case for it, and how to use it.</p>
<h2 id=3D"harnessing-the-models">Harnessing the models </h2>
<p>Claude Code can do everything that made OpenClaw go viral: Use tools, ma=
nage files, and run for hours on its own. That=E2=80=99s not a coincidence =
because underneath, the two are the same thing: a harness for an AI model. =
</p>
<p>Think of AI models=E2=80=94<u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:=
%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687=
adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiQ2xhdWRlIENvZGUgSXMgdGhlIE9wZW5Db=
GF3IEFsdGVybmF0aXZlIFlvdSBBbHJlYWR5IEhhdmUiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MzIxLCJwb3N0X3R5=
