xMIFKNvsZsSs14Wo=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Gemin=
i</a></u>=E2=80=94as powerful, capable horses. A harness is the thing that =
lets you direct that horsepower. It=E2=80=99s the software layer that sits =
between a raw AI model and the task you=E2=80=99re trying to accomplish. It=
 decides how the model receives context, which tools it can use, how it rem=
embers things across conversations, and how it talks to the outside world. =
</p>
<p>You=E2=80=99ve been using harnesses already: ChatGPT wraps a model in a =
chat interface that can browse the web and run code; Cursor wraps one in a =
code editor. Claude Code wraps one in something more open-ended: the abilit=
y to call tools, chain steps together, and work autonomously toward a goal.=
 Which is exactly what OpenClaw does. </p>
