stretching back to day one. Every message he sent was eating through tokens=
 because it was all crammed into one giant session.</p>
<p>With Claude Code over Slack, it works differently: One thread is one ses=
sion. Start a new thread and get a clean context window. Each session opens=
 with just its baseline instructions and your <u><a href=3D"https://icu.eve=
ry.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654=
