STEAL THIS WORKFLOW

AGENT SEE, AGENT DO

Here=E2=80=99s a scenario that may sound familiar: You=
 have a recurring computer task an agent could handle, but documenting =
every click, field, and exception would take longer than doing it yourself.

Every=E2=80=99s head of operations Arielle Shipper found a shortcut: She =
recorded a Slack video of herself completing the task, downloaded it, and =
gave it to an LLM to turn the demonstration into reusable instructions.

OpenAI=E2=80=99s new Record & Replay https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f9545=
5f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiQ2=
FuIEFJIExlYXJuIEdvb2QgSnVkZ21lbnQ_IiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDMxNywicG9zdF90eXBlIjoic=
G9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vZGV2ZWxvcGVycy5vcGVuYWkuY29tL2NvZGV4L3JlY29yZC1h=
bmQtcmVwbGF5IiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjI5fQ=3D=3D feature builds that method into =
Codex. It watches you complete a workflow on your Mac, then drafts an =
editable skill explaining when to use it, what integrations or context it =
needs to execute the task, what steps to follow, and how to check the =
result.

The workflow:

 1. Choose one stable task. Pick something =
that=E2=80=99s easier to show than explain: filing an expense, configuring =
an issue, or downloading a recurring report. Use realistic inputs without =
exposing secrets.
 2. Perform it for the agent. Use Record & Replay, or =
follow Arielle=E2=80=99s process and upload a screen recording with this =
prompt: =E2=80=9CTurn this demonstration into a reusable skill. Include its=
 trigger, required inputs, steps, and success checks. Flag any decisions =
you couldn=E2=80=99t infer.=E2=80=9D
 3. Add what the recording =
couldn=E2=80=99t see. Review the generated skill for hidden preferences, =
naming conventions, defaults, and exceptions. Test it on fresh inputs and =
correct the instructions where it goes astray.

Try it this week: Record =
the two-minute task you=E2=80=99ve avoided documenting because writing the =
instructions would take longer than doing it.



