<p><br></p>
<p>Writing with AI tends to be portrayed as a bargain: The machine does mor=
e, so the human does less. But in my experience=E2=80=94a microcosm of Ever=
y CEO <strong><u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2=
