<h2 id=3D"section-drafts-catch-weak-prose-early">Section drafts: Catch weak=
 prose early</h2>
<p>By the time I=E2=80=99m ready to draft, I=E2=80=99m in full chaos mode, =
so I lean on the skills that help me clean things up. I write section by se=
ction, and after each section I run /ai-check and /guardrails before moving=
 on. I am trying to catch that tell-tale smoothing while it is still local.=
 </p>
<p>I also run senior editor <strong><u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/=
https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619ea=
