Parrott) still used it to move through 24 drafts of this article in six to =
eight hours
 * How Sol found Arielle Shipper=E2=80=99s email, inspected 46 =
CSV files, and returned with seven useful questions=E2=80=94then made a =
calculation error serious enough to shake her trust


