      <p><strong><em>TL;DR:</em></strong><em> Our new guide, =E2=80=9CBuild=
 Faster With Voice,=E2=80=9D shows you how to turn raw speech into finished=
 work with AI agents. Join us on Friday, August 7, for <u><a href=3D"https:=
//every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefc=
c02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIERlZmluaXRpdmUgR3VpZGUgdG8gVXNpbmcgVm9pY=
