3NpdGlvbiI6Nn0=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Kate Lee</=
a></u></em></p>
<p><em>Was this newsletter forwarded to you? <u><a href=3D"https://every.to=
/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e=
242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIERlZmluaXRpdmUgR3VpZGUgdG8gVXNpbmcgVm9pY2UgV2l0aCB=
BSSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQzOTUsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZX=
