<p>Fable 5 has thrown the Every team into a new round of existential questi=
oning. It=E2=80=99s an obvious first choice for certain projects=E2=80=94th=
ose that are large, complex, and </p>
<p>delegable=E2=80=94and an arguably worse, too-expensive fit for others.</=
p>
