For most of the history of making software, writing code was the work. You =
spent your days typing out functions, fighting errors, debugging migrations=
, and reading through other people=E2=80=99s code to figure out why a =
function did what it did. Another day in the code factory.

That=E2=80=99s mostly over. With a good brainstorm and a well-structured =
plan https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce68=
7adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSG93IEkgUG9saXNoIFNvZnR3YXJlIFRoYX=
QgQWdlbnRzIEJ1aWx0IiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDMzOCwicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6I=
mh0dHBzOi8vZXZlcnkudG8vc291cmNlLWNvZGUvc3RvcC1jb2RpbmctYW5kLXN0YXJ0LXBsYW5u=
aW5nIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjZ9, today=E2=80=99s models will write code, run tests=
, fix failures, and hand you back a clean pull request with code changes =
ready for review. I=E2=80=99ll open my laptop in the morning to a stack of =
green pull requests that agents shipped overnight, with features ready to =
merge before my first meeting. The factory has been automated.

What I=E2=80=99m left to do is sit with the result and decide whether =
it=E2=80=99s any good=E2=80=94and then push it further than the agent could=
 take it itself. A model doesn=E2=80=99t know what I would call good, =
sitting in front of this feature in this product I=E2=80=99m building for =
these users. Without that final human judgment, everything the agent =
produces is functional, but forgettable. A few weeks ago I clicked on an =
email card in Cora https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f=
454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSG93IEkgUG9saXNoIFNv=
ZnR3YXJlIFRoYXQgQWdlbnRzIEJ1aWx0IiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDMzOCwicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9=
zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vY29yYS5jb21wdXRlciIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjo3fQ=3D=3D and =
knew instantly the animation was wrong=E2=80=94it slid in from the top of =
the screen instead of opening from where I=E2=80=99d clicked mid-screen. I =
told the agent, it fixed it, and I clicked again=E2=80=94better.

Polish is the final step in compound engineering https://every.=
to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e1896=
6e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSG93IEkgUG9saXNoIFNvZnR3YXJlIFRoYXQgQWdlbnRzIEJ1aWx0I=
