discipline I=E2=80=99ve been developing over the past year for building =
software in a way that gets smarter with every iteration. As more of the =
middle parts of the process https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f8=
7698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSG93IEkgUG9=
saXNoIFNvZnR3YXJlIFRoYXQgQWdlbnRzIEJ1aWx0IiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDMzOCwicG9zdF90eX=
BlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vd3d3LnlvdXR1YmUuY29tL3dhdGNoP3Y9RzBMVHY4a=
FE1Q3MiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6OX0=3D gets automated, polish matters more now, =
because it=E2=80=99s the part of the work that=E2=80=99s still yours. =
Instead of the assembly line worker putting the code together, =
you=E2=80=99re the person at the end of the line who decides whether =
it=E2=80=99s good enough to put your name on.


POLISH IN PRACTICE

The card animation that looked wrong is a good example of how polish works,=
 because animation is something that agents still struggle with (although =
it will improve over time).

The pull request had passed every automated =
check. The review agents had nothing left to flag for me. I ran =
/ce-polish=E2=80=94part of the compound engineering plugin https://every.=
to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e1896=
6e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSG93IEkgUG9saXNoIFNvZnR3YXJlIFRoYXQgQWdlbnRzIEJ1aWx0I=
iwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDMzOCwicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vZ2l0aHVi=
LmNvbS9FdmVyeUluYy9jb21wb3VuZC1lbmdpbmVlcmluZy1wbHVnaW4iLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MTB=
9=E2=80=94which does three things and then gets out of my way. It checks =
out the branch I want to polish, starts the development server in the =
background, and opens the running app inside my editor, right next to the =
agent. From there, I clicked on an email card to open it and started my =
assessment.

