lbnRzIEJ1aWx0IiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDMzOCwicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dH=
BzOi8vbW9ub2xvZ3VlLnRvIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjEyfQ=3D=3D. The agent tightened the=
 layout; the app hot-reloaded; I looked again=E2=80=94better. A plan could =
tell the agent to make the Brief feel like a magazine. It couldn=E2=80=99t =
tell the agent when the page had the right density. I had to see it and =
decide for myself.

