<h3><hr class=3D"quill-line"></h3>
<h2 id=3D"alignment">Alignment</h2>
<p><strong>The narrow promise.</strong> One problem with so many companies =
hurtling into AI drug discovery is that finding better candidates faster an=
d more cheaply is only one small part of bringing a drug to market. The <u>=
<a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619e=
afce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIE1vZGVsIElzIHRoZSBFYXN5=
