o2NX0=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">chart below</a></u>=
 is one of the clearest visualizations I=E2=80=99ve seen of this imbalance.=
 Discovery-to-lead=E2=80=94the dark-blue sliver on the left=E2=80=94covers =
identifying promising targets and optimizing them into drugs worth advancin=
g. Everything after it=E2=80=94confirming the lab tests and cells used to e=
valuate a candidate are accurate and reliable (assay and cell line validati=
on), then manufacturing, animal toxicology, and three phases of human trial=
s=E2=80=94occupies nearly 99 percent of the remaining bar.</p>
