09O9E4=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">ground in San F=
rancisco</a></u> for Apple=E2=80=99s Worldwide Developers Conference last m=
onth, Monologue general manager Naveen Naidu noticed a new metric for measu=
ring enterprise productivity making the tech-circle rounds: revenue per mil=
lion tokens.</p>
<p>A purported measure of a company=E2=80=99s efficiency, revenue per milli=
on tokens is a potential successor to <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL=
0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619=
