b-000000/tu31G8iyON_cHoPEU1O5WuXWtDEpMNglA67jkw-cRL0=3D452" rel=3D"noopener=
 noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">revenue per employee</a></u>, a rough estima=
te for how much money each worker at a company generates. (AI-native compan=
ies tend to score <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.=
to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc0=
2e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiV2VsY29tZSB0byBFZmZpY2llbmN5bWF4eGluZyIsInBvc=
3RfaWQiOjQzMzEsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL3d3dy5mb3JiZXMu=
Y29tL3NpdGVzL3BhdWxiYWllci8yMDI2LzAzLzMxL2FpLW5hdGl2ZS1maXJtcy1sZWFkLWluLXJ=
ldmVudWUtcGVyLWVtcGxveWVlLyIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjozNX0=3D/1/0100019f42813184-d41b=
28cf-2d36-4de9-981d-97a392ee831b-000000/Dw2WzXZKDzYOCrwudJVSJXOYIh_hO9tbc4i=
_mVvbmhs=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">significantly=
 higher</a></u> on this scorecard than their traditional SaaS counterparts.=
) </p>
<p>By explicitly tying ROI to how efficiently a company makes money with AI=
, revenue per million tokens acknowledges that engineering has become cheap=
 while the cost of compute is more expensive than ever. Or more simply: =E2=
=80=9CIf you say, =E2=80=98I wrote a million lines of code,=E2=80=99 did it=
 actually increase your revenue or not?=E2=80=9D Naveen says.</p>
