dmVyeS50by92aWJlLWNoZWNrL2dwdC01LTYtc29sIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjExfQ=3D=3D =
generate for the same assignment. And I used it through the web console and=
 the API.

At the sentence level, Deft=E2=80=99s prose was more varied and =
surprising than most AI writing I read. It was also dense, hard to parse, =
and poorly sequenced. The Deft web interface includes a reading score, and =
it rated its own output at an 11th-grade reading level. (For context, 54 =
percent of U.S. adults read at a sixth-grade level https://every.=
