d3cudGhlbmF0aW9uYWxsaXRlcmFjeWluc3RpdHV0ZS5jb20vMjAyNC0yMDI1LWxpdGVyYWN5LXN=
0YXRpc3RpY3MiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MTJ9 or lower, according to the National =
Literacy Institute). The introduction to the SEO article gave me jumbled =
phrases like =E2=80=9Ca vocabulary of word choices that are synonyms,=
=E2=80=9D =E2=80=9Cexamples of great examples,=E2=80=9D and =
=E2=80=9CThat=E2=80=99s a lot to keep in mind for every write.=E2=80=9D The=
 phrases were unusual. They were not clear.

