XJkZXItdGhhbi15b3UtdGhpbmsiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MTZ9 rarely moves from brief to =
finished draft in one jump. I want to go back and forth with the model, =
keep certain parts of its output and rework others https://every.=
