<p><br></p>
<p>For now, the model is available via Deft=E2=80=99s website and paid API.=
 You supply a prompt, choose whether you want the model to work faster, sma=
rter, or =E2=80=9Cmore human,=E2=80=9D and choose an output format from a s=
election of four: news article, analytical essay, SEO article, or company b=
log. Advanced controls let you describe your writing style or paste in an e=
xample for the model to emulate. It also includes an option to choose betwe=
en =E2=80=9Cstrict=E2=80=9D and =E2=80=9Ccreative=E2=80=9D modes. Strict mo=
de promises to =E2=80=9Cuse only the details in your prompt=E2=80=9D; creat=
ive mode can invent supporting specifics. </p>
<h2 id=3D"how-deft-of-a-writer-is-deft">How deft of a writer is Deft? </h2>
<p>To test the model, I had Deft write an analytical essay on how AI is aff=
ecting jobs and an SEO article on how to write an AI style guide. I asked i=
t to draft from scratch and then to rewrite an existing draft I=E2=80=99d h=
ad <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fc=
lick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2Fe=
yJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSSBUcmllZCB0aGUgQUkgTW9kZWwgQnVpbHQgdG8gRml4IEFJIFdyaXRpbmci=
LCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0NDUwLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS5=
0by92aWJlLWNoZWNrL2dwdC01LTYtc29sIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjExfQ=3D=3D/1/010001a0356=
