<p>At the sentence level, Deft=E2=80=99s prose was more varied and surprisi=
ng than most AI writing I read. It was also dense, hard to parse, and poorl=
y sequenced. The Deft web interface includes a reading score, and it rated =
its own output at an 11th-grade reading level. (For context, 54 percent of =
U.S. adults <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Fe=
mails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e1896=
6e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSSBUcmllZCB0aGUgQUkgTW9kZWwgQnVpbHQgdG8gRml4IEFJIFd=
