93d3cudGhlbmF0aW9uYWxsaXRlcmFjeWluc3RpdHV0ZS5jb20vMjAyNC0yMDI1LWxpdGVyYWN5L=
XN0YXRpc3RpY3MiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MTJ9/1/010001a035684ea4-48bc57a3-952b-405f-9=
466-b0944c302653-000000/MRGiAsxzvqUz7kFUpWqEpt__lBgE3PpH1AEvu1oXnYY=3D452" =
rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">read at a sixth-grade level</=
a></u> or lower, according to the National Literacy Institute). The introdu=
ction to the SEO article gave me jumbled phrases like =E2=80=9Ca vocabulary=
 of word choices that are synonyms,=E2=80=9D =E2=80=9Cexamples of great exa=
mples,=E2=80=9D and =E2=80=9CThat=E2=80=99s a lot to keep in mind for every=
 write.=E2=80=9D The phrases were unusual. They were not clear.</p>
