dGUtY29ubmVjdGlvbnMiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MjF9/1/0100019fd3267c6e-c81ceb58-9243-4=
14d-9cac-6081ee7da1e1-000000/xSXCfClByWAAomelgeHevIyywMF25geXCr0QAsCzoGI=3D=
452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Remote</a></u> connectio=
ns=E2=80=94but only while the host computer is awake, online, and running t=
he desktop app. Without that connection, voice can=E2=80=99t access the hos=
t=E2=80=99s <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Fe=
mails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e1896=
6e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiTWluaS1WaWJlIENoZWNrOiBDaGF0R1BUIFZvaWNlIE1vZGUiLCJ=
wb3N0X2lkIjo0NDAwLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwcm9tbyIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vZXZlcnkudG=
