If Every were a normal company, I=E2=80=99d hesitate to publicly disagree =
with my CEO. It isn=E2=80=99t, so here goes: I don=E2=80=99t think the =
=E2=80=9Cforever=E2=80=9D part holds up.

The dynamic Dan describes matches=
