referrer" target=3D"_blank">joins the discourse</a></u> about sandboxes=E2=
=80=94controlled environments for developing and testing AI models=E2=80=94=
with an argument that agents need fences=E2=80=94explicit rules about what =
each agent is allowed to do=E2=80=94rather than technical barriers designed=
 to constrain it from the outside in. Cursor <u><a href=3D"https://icu.ever=
y.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f=
454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiQmVuY2htYXJrcyBEb2=
7igJl0IEtub3cgWW91ciBKb2IiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0NDUxLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0Iiwid=
XJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9jdXJzb3IuY29tL2Jsb2cvZ2l0LWF0LWFueS1zY2FsZSIsInBvc2l0aW9u=
IjoxOH0=3D/1/010001a03a6c3493-c00ebefb-975f-4dda-ae37-c5b8f6ba32b6-000000/7=
PQwir9VAmPQdqGKHDCliM8EATt8jx1bbpDj9wjdJDM=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferre=
r" target=3D"_blank">explains</a></u> why it rebuilt its Git hosting: Codin=
g agents create huge numbers of short-lived repositories. Its new system st=
ores every code change in the cloud, then creates or discards working copie=
s as agents need them. Andressen Horowitz general partner <strong>Martin Ca=
sado</strong> <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2=
Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18=
966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiQmVuY2htYXJrcyBEb27igJl0IEtub3cgWW91ciBKb2IiLCJwb=
3N0X2lkIjo0NDUxLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly94LmNvbS9tYXJ0=
aW5fY2FzYWRvL3N0YXR1cy8yMDkxOTA1NTA5NDk0NDg5NTg4IiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjE5fQ=3D=
=3D/1/010001a03a6c3493-c00ebefb-975f-4dda-ae37-c5b8f6ba32b6-000000/jPPD-afP=
UkOfxlRVvAk_sUD9fNFnxGzYhxt6Y9A5BgU=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" targ=
et=3D"_blank">argues</a></u> that Fable=E2=80=99s low market share is a pri=
vacy problem: The model retains the data companies send it and does not off=
er a zero-data-retention option, making it a nonstarter for companies with =
strict data policies. <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fev=
ery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebe=
fcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiQmVuY2htYXJrcyBEb27igJl0IEtub3cgWW91ciBKb=
2IiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0NDUxLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9hcnhp=
di5vcmcvYWJzLzI2MDguMTg1NTQiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MjB9/1/010001a03a6c3493-c00ebef=
