YlasU=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">CentaurBench</a>=
</u> found that the model best at completing a task on its own was not nece=
ssarily the best helper. On five of seven tasks, a different model was bett=
er at improving a weaker model=E2=80=99s first attempt. And <u><a href=3D"h=
ttps://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f0=
5e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiQmV=
uY2htYXJrcyBEb27igJl0IEtub3cgWW91ciBKb2IiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0NDUxLCJwb3N0X3R5cG=
