eS50by9AamFja2NoZW5nIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjZ9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" targe=
t=3D"_blank">Jack Cheng</a></em></strong><em> took on the project himself. =
The process showed us that people across Every can now build and test ideas=
 without taking engineers away from more important work.=E2=80=94<a href=3D=
"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adc=
e5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSG93IFdlIEJ1aWx0IEdpZnQgTGlua3MiLCJwb3=
