Rpb24iOjh9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Sign up</a></u> t=
o get it in your inbox.</em></p>
<p></p>
<hr class=3D"quill-line">
<p></p>
<p>Last month, we rolled out gift links on the Every website. If you have a=
 paid or <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e=
654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSG93IFdlIEJ1aWx0=
IEdpZnQgTGlua3MiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MzQ2LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR=
0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9vbi1ldmVyeS9pbnRyb2R1Y2luZy1ldmVyeS1hbGwtYWNjZXNzIiwicG=
9zaXRpb24iOjl9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">All Access</a=
></u> membership, you can now share paywalled articles with people who aren=
=E2=80=99t Every members. Standard paid members can share five gift links e=
ach month, with the count resetting on the first of the month. All Access m=
embers can, starting today, share unlimited gift links.</p>
<p>Gift links by themselves aren=E2=80=99t novel. You=E2=80=99ve likely int=
eracted with them in articles in the online editions of the <em>Wall Street=
 Journal</em>, the<em> Atlantic</em>, or the <em>New York Times</em>. But t=
hose publications also have product teams larger than our entire company of=
 30 people.</p>
<p>Many of us at Every are veterans of organizations structured to dampen r=
isk and dodge uncertainty, often at the cost of experimentation. We=E2=80=
=99re learning to <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e=
60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSG93IFd=
lIEJ1aWx0IEdpZnQgTGlua3MiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MzQ2LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidX=
JsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9zb3VyY2UtY29kZS9pbnNpZGUtdGhlLWFpLXdvcmtmbG93c=
y1vZi1ldmVyeS1zLXNpeC1lbmdpbmVlcnMiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MTB9" rel=3D"noopener no=
referrer" target=3D"_blank">explore new workflows</a></u>, cede control to =
AI agents <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698=
e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSG93IFdlIEJ1aWx=
0IEdpZnQgTGlua3MiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MzQ2LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaH=
R0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9ndWlkZXMvdGhlLWVpZ2h0LWxldmVscy1vZi1haS1hZG9wdGlvbiIsI=
nBvc2l0aW9uIjoxMX0=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">when i=
t makes sense</a></u>, and embrace the fact that good ideas can come <u><a =
href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafc=
e687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSG93IFdlIEJ1aWx0IEdpZnQgTGlua3M=
iLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MzQ2LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS=
50by9jb250ZXh0LXdpbmRvdy9jb2RleC1mb3ItZXZlcnl0aGluZy1hbmQtZXZlcnlvbmUiLCJwb=
3NpdGlvbiI6MTJ9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">from anyone<=
/a></u>=E2=80=94and now be built by anyone.</p>
<p>The path our small editorial team charted to ship the new gift links fea=
ture is a case study in how AI tools can turn a heavy organizational lift i=
nto a feasible experiment, and how an AI-native company decides what to bui=
ld.</p>
<p>Here=E2=80=99s how we did it.</p>
<h2 id=3D"scratching-my-own-itch">Scratching my own itch</h2>
<p>As a senior editor at Every, I=E2=80=99ve edited dozens of pieces by our=
 team and outside contributors, as well as written my own essays on <u><a h=
ref=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce=
687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSG93IFdlIEJ1aWx0IEdpZnQgTGlua3Mi=
LCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MzQ2LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS5=
0by9wL3doYXQtYmVjb21lcy12YWx1YWJsZS13aGVuLWFpLW1ha2VzLWNyZWF0aXZlLXdvcmstZW=
FzeSIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjoxM30=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank"=
>creativity</a></u>, <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f=
05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSG93=
IFdlIEJ1aWx0IEdpZnQgTGlua3MiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MzQ2LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0Iiw=
idXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9wL3doYXQtaXMtdGFzdGUtcmVhbGx5IiwicG9zaXRpb2=
4iOjE0fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">taste</a></u>=
, and <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654=
f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSG93IFdlIEJ1aWx0IEd=
pZnQgTGlua3MiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MzQ2LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cH=
M6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9wL2ktaGlyZWQtYW4tYWktdG8tZG8tbXktY2hvcmVzLW5vdy1pLW1haW50Y=
WluLXRoZS1haSIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjoxNX0=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=
=3D"_blank">maintenance</a></u>. I=E2=80=99m proud of our work. I regularly=
 share links to it in my <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95=
455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0Ijoi=
SG93IFdlIEJ1aWx0IEdpZnQgTGlua3MiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MzQ2LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N=
0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9qYWNrY2hlbmcuY29tL3N1bmRheSIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjoxNn0=3D=
" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">personal newsletter</a></u>=
.</p>
<p>When I share articles from other paid publications, though, I usually us=
e gift links. Some of my favorite blogs, like <u><a href=3D"https://every.t=
o/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966=
e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSG93IFdlIEJ1aWx0IEdpZnQgTGlua3MiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MzQ2LC=
Jwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly93d3cubWV0YWZpbHRlci5jb20vIiwic=
G9zaXRpb24iOjE3fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Meta=
filter</a></u> or <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f9=
5455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0Ijo=
iSG93IFdlIEJ1aWx0IEdpZnQgTGlua3MiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MzQ2LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3=
N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9rb3R0a2Uub3JnIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjE4fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"=
noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Jason Kottke</a></u></strong>=E2=80=
=99s, tend to share paywalled articles as gift links as well. As much as I =
wanted gift links for myself, I saw a business case for them. Were we limit=
ing Every=E2=80=99s reach and potential for virality by not giving people a=
 way to share paywalled content?</p>
<p>To find out, I started digging.</p>
<p>I first searched Every=E2=80=99s Slack and Discord channels to see if an=
yone had raised the idea before. Maybe we=E2=80=99d even tried gift links i=
n the past, or the feature had been proposed and declined for reasons I had=
n=E2=80=99t considered. My search turned up a message from <strong><u><a hr=
ef=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce6=
87adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSG93IFdlIEJ1aWx0IEdpZnQgTGlua3MiL=
CJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MzQ2LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50=
by9Aa2F0ZV8xNzY3IiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjE5fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" t=
arget=3D"_blank">Kate Lee</a></u></strong>, Every=E2=80=99s editor in chief=
, also wondering about gift links. Each article in our system had a preview=
 link that bypassed the paywall, but the feature was more meant for sharing=
 drafts internally. </p>
