ys.</p>
<p>Specialization also lowers costs by routing routine work to cheaper mode=
ls. Just as you wouldn=E2=80=99t have a CEO reformat a spreadsheet, and you=
 wouldn=E2=80=99t ask Fable to rename a batch of files.</p>
<h4 id=3D"do-you-speak-agent"><strong>Do you speak agent?</strong></h4>
<p>The model org chart may explain why some AI output feels as though it wa=
sn=E2=80=99t written for humans. Wharton professor <strong>Ethan Mollick</s=
trong> has watched long Fable tasks develop a <u><a href=3D"https://every.t=
o/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966=
