DQ4NDIyNjExP3M9MjAiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MTd9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=
=3D"_blank">distinctive dialect</a></u> as agents communicate with one anot=
her, making =E2=80=9CClaudish language ever more Claudish.=E2=80=9D Progres=
s reports collapse into labels, fragments, and technical shorthand.</p>
