nk">prickly model</a></u>=E2=80=94primarily as a subagent under Fable. If a=
nother model is the audience, pleasant prose is wasted effort. =E2=80=9CIt =
doesn=E2=80=99t matter that Opus has linguistic patterns that humans find a=
brasive, it mostly talks to Fable,=E2=80=9D he says. </p>
<p>The problem is when that shorthand reaches a person. Head of consulting =
<strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e6=
54f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiRmFibGUgYXMgQ0VPI=
