arget=3D"_blank">Natalia Quintero</a></u></strong> recently used Fable to a=
nalyze a large dataset. She said that its subagents=E2=80=99 reports read =
=E2=80=9Clike gibberish.=E2=80=9D </p>
<p>Maybe she wasn=E2=80=99t the intended audience. But Fable=E2=80=99s draf=
t memos were difficult to parse too.</p>
