<h2 id=3D"inside-every">Inside Every</h2>
<h4 id=3D"making-slack-agent-native"><strong>Making Slack agent-native</str=
ong></h4>
<p>If you=E2=80=99ve been following our coverage, you know that many people=
 at Every=E2=80=94CEO <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7=
c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN=
0IjoiV2hhdCBJZiBTbGFjayBXYXMgWW91ciBBSSBDb21tYW5kIENlbnRlciIsInBvc3RfaWQiOj=
QzNjAsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL0BkYW5zaGlwc=
GVyIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjZ9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Dan =
Shipper</a></u></strong>, head of growth <strong><u><a href=3D"https://ever=
y.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18=
966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiV2hhdCBJZiBTbGFjayBXYXMgWW91ciBBSSBDb21tYW5kIENlbnR=
lciIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQzNjAsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZX=
J5LnRvL0B0ZWRlc2NhdSIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjo3fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer"=
 target=3D"_blank">Austin Tedesco</a></u></strong>, and head of operations =
<strong>Arielle Shipper</strong>, to name a few=E2=80=94have reduced the me=
ntal fragmentation of bouncing between apps by working almost exclusively <=
u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c61=
9eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiV2hhdCBJZiBTbGFjayBXYXMgWW=
91ciBBSSBDb21tYW5kIENlbnRlciIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQzNjAsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiL=
CJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL2NvbnRleHQtd2luZG93L2NvZGV4LWluLXByYWN0aWNl=
IiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjh9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">within =
Codex</a></u>. It=E2=80=99s where they handle emails, write Slack messages,=
 build new features, and draft articles using Codex=E2=80=99s in-app browse=
r. </p>
<p>Senior applied AI engineer <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails=
/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJ=
zdWJqZWN0IjoiV2hhdCBJZiBTbGFjayBXYXMgWW91ciBBSSBDb21tYW5kIENlbnRlciIsInBvc3=
RfaWQiOjQzNjAsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL0Bua=
XR5ZXNoIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjl9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">=
Nityesh Agarwal</a></u></strong> is a fan of the general concept but thinks=
 there=E2=80=99s a better, model-agnostic platform for AI-assisted work: Sl=
ack, which is optimized to make it easy to manage multiple tasks at once an=
d reduce context-switching.</p>
<p><strong>Here=E2=80=99s how he turned the platform into an agent-native o=
perating system</strong><em> </em></p>
<p>Nityesh first created a personal Slack coding agent=E2=80=94named Luo Ji=
, after the protagonist in science fiction series <em>The Three-Body Proble=
m</em>. Slack has long allowed developers to create bots and apps on its pl=
atform and connect them to outside servers. Using that infrastructure, Nity=
esh connected Luo Ji to <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f954=
55f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiV=
2hhdCBJZiBTbGFjayBXYXMgWW91ciBBSSBDb21tYW5kIENlbnRlciIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQzNjAs=
InBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL3NvdXJjZS1jb2RlL2N=
sYXVkZS1jb2RlLWlzLXRoZS1vcGVuY2xhdy1hbHRlcm5hdGl2ZS15b3UtYWxyZWFkeS1oYXZlIi=
wicG9zaXRpb24iOjEwfQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">C=
laude Code</a></u> on a spare Macbook Air, which functions as a server. </p=
>
<p>Then he modified the connector script to meet his specifications, includ=
ing a routing rule: Each top-level message in a Slack channel kicks off a n=
ew Claude Code session, while a reply in the resulting message thread resum=
es that same session. (He used the same general setup to <u><a href=3D"http=
s://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebe=
fcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiV2hhdCBJZiBTbGFjayBXYXMgWW91ciBBSSBDb21tYW5=
kIENlbnRlciIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQzNjAsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwcz=
ovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL3Avd2hhdC1pLWxlYXJuZWQtb25ib2FyZGluZy1vdXItYWktcHJvamVjdC1tY=
W5hZ2VyIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjExfQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"=
_blank">build Claudie</a></u>, the consulting team=E2=80=99s AI project man=
ager.)</p>
