<p>It was Monday morning, and my cofounder Brian was reading from our agent=
=E2=80=99s weekly analysis of customer discovery calls. =E2=80=9CSubscripti=
on retention,=E2=80=9D he said. =E2=80=9CFive separate brands mentioned it =
as their top priority, and none of them trust existing AI tools to touch it=
.=E2=80=9D </p>
<p>Just weeks ago, unearthing an insight like this would=E2=80=99ve been ne=
arly impossible.</p>
<p>At my pre-product-market fit startup, we=E2=80=99d all been speaking wit=
h prospects and trying to figure out the positioning for our product, but k=
eeping track of everything we learned was a mess across founders, platforms=
, and mediums. To share what we learned during our Monday meeting, Brian wo=
uld read notes in Slack, collect transcripts from Granola, and try to make =
sense of it all in Claude Code.</p>
<p>We couldn=E2=80=99t afford to be that disorganized. We=E2=80=99d recentl=
y launched <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Fem=
ails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966=
e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiV2UgQnVpbHQgT3VyIE93biBBZ2VudC1uYXRpdmUgVG9vbC4gSXQg=
T3ZlcmhhdWxlZCBIb3cgV2UgQnVpbGQgU29mdHdhcmUuIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDMwMywicG9zdF9=
0eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHA6Ly9ob29wLmFwcD91dG1fc291cmNlPUV2ZXJ5XHUwMD=
I2dXRtX21lZGl1bT1hcnRpY2xlXHUwMDI2dXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPWFnZW50bmF0aXZlIiwicG9za=
XRpb24iOjl9/1/0100019ed1131991-4e793bb2-1f5b-4705-9db3-2db122d0f646-000000/=
cHmBqKpPgvX_61_qCxEGR4tNP8uVD11TzPpI8CUTOec=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferr=
er" target=3D"_blank">Hoop</a></u>, an agent that helps subscription brands=
 reduce churn, and we needed to learn as quickly as we could. So we had to =
talk to as many potential customers as possible, then rigorously document a=
nd score each call to separate polite interest from genuine demand. Everyon=
e on our five-person team was putting in the effort, but each of us had our=
 own process, our own tools, and our own interpretation of what happened on=
 each customer call.</p>
<p>So my two cofounders and I=E2=80=94none of us with =E2=80=9Cengineer=E2=
=80=9D in our title=E2=80=94built an internal tool to fix it. What we didn=
=E2=80=99t expect was that the tool would change how we built our actual pr=
oduct for customers, too.</p>  <div class=3D"ea-block normal">
