d something for this=E2=80=99</strong></h2>
<p>Our Monday meetings were so unmethodical because the information from ou=
r client calls was in different places depending on who had taken the call =
and whether they had notes based on Granola or another transcription tool. =
We had no way to see patterns and draw conclusions about what our potential=
 customers wanted.  </p>
<p>Justin, my cofounder and the resident product expert, built the first ve=
rsion of a tool to bring those notes together in under 10 hours over a few =
days, fitting it in around his other priorities.</p>
<p>Here=E2=80=99s how it worked: You=E2=80=99d upload a Zoom transcript, th=
e tool would run the transcript through four or five prompts, and you=E2=80=
=99d get a structured analysis scored against <u><a href=3D"https://icu.eve=
ry.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654=
f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiV2UgQnVpbHQgT3VyI=
E93biBBZ2VudC1uYXRpdmUgVG9vbC4gSXQgT3ZlcmhhdWxlZCBIb3cgV2UgQnVpbGQgU29mdHdh=
cmUuIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDMwMywicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vdGh=
lcGh5c2ljc29mc3RhcnR1cHMuc3Vic3RhY2suY29tL3AvdGhlLXB1bGwtZnJhbWV3b3JrIiwicG=
9zaXRpb24iOjE0fQ=3D=3D/1/0100019ed1131991-4e793bb2-1f5b-4705-9db3-2db122d0f=
646-000000/XCJtEaRYAN_jizcauhT-bG0qFxHg1yBbu0TWXn5T2zo=3D452" rel=3D"noopen=
er noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">the PULL criteria</a></u>=E2=80=94a framew=
ork developed at Harvard Business School to help early-stage startups find =
product-market fit. The tool would also pull together all the conversations=
 with a given prospect into a summary, so you could see the full arc of a r=
elationship instead of just a snapshot from one call. Rather than digging t=
hrough notes and transcripts, the tool gave us a consolidated analysis week=
 over week to help us see what was working and what wasn=E2=80=99t.</p>
<p>Justin set up the app using tools we hadn=E2=80=99t used before: <u><a h=
ref=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3=
f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN=
0IjoiV2UgQnVpbHQgT3VyIE93biBBZ2VudC1uYXRpdmUgVG9vbC4gSXQgT3ZlcmhhdWxlZCBIb3=
cgV2UgQnVpbGQgU29mdHdhcmUuIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDMwMywicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsI=
nVybCI6Imh0dHA6Ly9uZXh0LmpzIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjE1fQ=3D=3D/1/0100019ed1131991-=
4e793bb2-1f5b-4705-9db3-2db122d0f646-000000/Zj9qzyZEvAeRNYczidsrHwzN3o4Gwnd=
tjzDGG8NwAvg=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Next.js f=
ramework</a></u> with <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fev=
ery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebe=
fcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiV2UgQnVpbHQgT3VyIE93biBBZ2VudC1uYXRpdmUgV=
G9vbC4gSXQgT3ZlcmhhdWxlZCBIb3cgV2UgQnVpbGQgU29mdHdhcmUuIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDMw=
MywicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vdWkuc2hhZGNuLmNvbS8iLCJwb3N=
pdGlvbiI6MTZ9/1/0100019ed1131991-4e793bb2-1f5b-4705-9db3-2db122d0f646-00000=
0/OvzqWgZzSOgnSc--jBf6tbOeWsLqMyS-eG30ZXmk68k=3D452" rel=3D"noopener norefe=
rrer" target=3D"_blank">ShadCN components</a></u> for the user interface, S=
upabase for the database that compiled all the notes, Claude=E2=80=99s API =
for the analysis. </p>
<p>For Justin, who had studied computer science but wasn=E2=80=99t writing =
much code anymore, it was an opportunity to dust off his skills and build h=
is confidence with AI-native coding. He started by designing and building t=
he visual interface because he is the kind of person who gets frustrated wh=
en software doesn=E2=80=99t look right, even if it functions. He made sure =
that the look and feel of the tool matched our brand, and got the component=
s (buttons, labels, menus) looking clean before he went anywhere near the d=
ata.</p>
<p>Only then did he go straight to the data. He had to make sure that the t=
ool=E2=80=99s analysis of the customer conversations was better than what p=
eople were already producing on their own with Claude. Otherwise, we would =
never convince the whole team to use the same tool. So he created a prompt =
that he tweaked after manually reviewing the output several times and relyi=
ng on <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%=
2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%=
2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiV2UgQnVpbHQgT3VyIE93biBBZ2VudC1uYXRpdmUgVG9vbC4gSXQgT3Zlc=
mhhdWxlZCBIb3cgV2UgQnVpbGQgU29mdHdhcmUuIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDMwMywicG9zdF90eXBl=
IjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vcGxhdGZvcm0uY2xhdWRlLmNvbS9kb2NzL2VuL2J1aWx=
kLXdpdGgtY2xhdWRlL3Byb21wdC1lbmdpbmVlcmluZy9jbGF1ZGUtcHJvbXB0aW5nLWJlc3QtcH=
JhY3RpY2VzIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjE3fQ=3D=3D/1/0100019ed1131991-4e793bb2-1f5b-470=
5-9db3-2db122d0f646-000000/iNq4AGqKv9kbtfU67ZsLn8jZrrbSPPnVRDHaSs33azU=3D45=
2" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Anthropic=E2=80=99s prompt=
ing best practices</a></u> for Claude. </p>
