We=E2=80=99re kicking off a series on =E2=80=9Cunlearning=E2=80=9D in =
partnership with Maven, the expert-led course platform. Over the next three=
 weeks, you=E2=80=99ll hear three different takes from Maven instructors on=
 what we need to let go of as AI changes how we work. First up is Hilary =
Gridley, who previously led product at Whoop. She explains why faster =
prototypes don=E2=80=99t make product decisions easier=E2=80=94and how =
teams can decide which ideas are worth building.=E2=80=94Kate Lee =
https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce=
5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiRHJvd25pbmcgaW4gRGVtb3M_IEhlcmXigJlzIGE=
