  <div class=3D"post-body">
    <p class=3D"post-preview-warning">This is a free preview of a subscribe=
rs-only post.</p>
      <p>On Friday, we published our <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/=
click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJz=
dWJqZWN0IjoiVGFtaW5nIE9wdXMgNSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQzNTksInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InByb21=
vIiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by92aWJlLWNoZWNrL29wdXMtNSIsInBvc2l0aW9uIj=
o1fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Vibe Check of Cla=
ude Opus 5</a></u>. A small group of us had spent the week testing it, and =
we found a model that was brilliant in flashes and frustrating in practice.=
 Then the rest of the Every team got their hands on it.</p>
<p>Their experiences over the weekend confirmed the model=E2=80=99s unrulin=
ess=E2=80=94and suggested a way to tame it. We also have the second essay i=
n our series in partnership with Maven on =E2=80=9Cunlearning,=E2=80=9D a w=
orkflow for checking whether skills built for an older model are getting in=
 the new one=E2=80=99s way, and a theory as to why one-shot AI demos of vid=
eo games clog your social feeds.</p>
<p><em>Was this newsletter forwarded to you?</em> <em><u><a href=3D"https:/=
/every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc=
02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGFtaW5nIE9wdXMgNSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQzNTksInBvc3=
RfdHlwZSI6InByb21vIiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9zdWJzY3JpYmUiLCJwb3Npd=
GlvbiI6Nn0=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Sign up</a></u=
> to get it in your inbox.</em></p>
<h2><hr class=3D"quill-line"></h2>
<h2 id=3D"pulse-check"><strong>Pulse check</strong></h2>
<h4 id=3D"getting-thrown-by-opus-5"><strong>Getting thrown by Opus 5</stron=
g></h4>
<p>Toward the end of Every=E2=80=99s all-team standup on Monday, the conver=
sation turned to Opus 5. More people from the team had tried it by then, an=
d the same quirks kept coming up.</p>
<p>Head of operations <strong>Arielle Shipper</strong> found that Opus 5 ne=
eded too much management and repeated prompting to keep its responses simpl=
e=E2=80=94more than Fable or Opus 4.8. <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.=
to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e1896=
6e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGFtaW5nIE9wdXMgNSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQzNTksInBvc3RfdHlwZ=
SI6InByb21vIiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9jb3JhLmNvbXB1dGVyIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjd9" re=
l=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Cora</a></u></strong> general m=
anager <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f=
87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGFtaW5nIE=
9wdXMgNSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQzNTksInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InByb21vIiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6L=
y9ldmVyeS50by9Aa2llcmFuXzEzNTUiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6OH0=3D" rel=3D"noopener nore=
ferrer" target=3D"_blank">Kieran Klaassen</a></u></strong> advanced a theor=
y that the new Opus is intended to be a subagent to Fable, and communicates=
 as though it were speaking to agents instead of humans.</p>
<p>It was also prickly; during a decluttering project, Opus successfully in=
ventoried head of consulting <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/=
click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJz=
dWJqZWN0IjoiVGFtaW5nIE9wdXMgNSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQzNTksInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InByb21=
vIiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9AbmF0YWxpYV8yOTQ0IiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjl9" =
rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Natalia Quintero</a></u></str=
ong>=E2=80=99s belongings and planned donations, but adopted an irritating,=
 judgmental tone, criticizing her for owning 15 water bottles. Senior edito=
r <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698=
e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGFtaW5nIE9wdXM=
gNSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQzNTksInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InByb21vIiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldm=
VyeS50by9AamFja2NoZW5nIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjEwfQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener norefer=
rer" target=3D"_blank">Jack Cheng</a></u></strong> shared a screenshot of O=
pus backhandedly calling one of his comments the most interesting thing he =
had said all session. Software engineer <strong>Kai Zau</strong> thought An=
thropic had dialed up the model=E2=80=99s disagreeableness, while fellow en=
gineer <strong>Lee Knowlton</strong> joked that Opus 6 might finally tell u=
sers they had said something insightful.</p>
<p>Prickliness aside, the team converged toward a specific way of working w=
ith the new Opus model. CEO <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/c=
lick/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzd=
WJqZWN0IjoiVGFtaW5nIE9wdXMgNSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQzNTksInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InByb21v=
IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9AZGFuc2hpcHBlciIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjoxMX0=3D"=
 rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Dan Shipper</a></u></strong>=
 and <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87=
698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGFtaW5nIE9w=
dXMgNSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQzNTksInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InByb21vIiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9=
3cml0ZXRoZXNwaXJhbC5jb20iLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MTJ9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" =
target=3D"_blank">Spiral</a></u></strong> general manager <strong><u><a hre=
f=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce68=
7adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGFtaW5nIE9wdXMgNSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOj=
QzNTksInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InByb21vIiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9AbWFyY3VzX=
2ZkODMwMl8xIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjEzfQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=
=3D"_blank">Marcus Moretti</a></u></strong> had both handed Opus a substant=
ial job with a clear finish line, then left it alone. Jack told it he was a=
bout to step away from the computer, and to batch its work and ask any bloc=
king questions. All three got good results. <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/=
emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e2=
42/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGFtaW5nIE9wdXMgNSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQzNTksInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6=
InByb21vIiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9wbGF0Zm9ybS5jbGF1ZGUuY29tL2RvY3MvZW4vYnVpbGQ=
td2l0aC1jbGF1ZGUvcHJvbXB0LWVuZ2luZWVyaW5nL3Byb21wdGluZy1jbGF1ZGUtb3B1cy01Ii=
wicG9zaXRpb24iOjE0fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">A=
nthropic=E2=80=99s prompting guide</a></u> makes the same recommendation: P=
ut the full brief in the first prompt and let Opus run.</p>
<p>Then, when it comes back, evaluate the finished artifact on its own, wit=
hout getting bogged down in Claude=E2=80=99s narration of how it got there.=
 If the output is good but Opus=E2=80=99s explanations are hard to parse, t=
ry this <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e6=
54f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGFtaW5nIE9wdXMgN=
SIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQzNTksInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InByb21vIiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9naXRo=
dWIuY29tL2F5Z2hyaS9pLWhhdmUtYWRoZCIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjoxNX0=3D" rel=3D"noopener=
 noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">I Have ADHD Skill</a></u> (12,000 stars and =
counting). Head of education <strong>Micah Rich </strong>put the rules from=
 the skill about being concise and action-oriented into Claude=E2=80=99s <u=
><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619=
