5jb20vZG9jcy9lbi9vdXRwdXQtc3R5bGVzIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjE2fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noop=
ener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">output styles</a></u>, so they filter th=
e model=E2=80=99s communications without you having to repeat =E2=80=9CI do=
n=E2=80=99t understand what you=E2=80=99re saying=E2=80=9D over and over. <=
/p>
<p>I=E2=80=99m still figuring out where that leaves me. I gave Opus materia=
ls for a presentation I=E2=80=99m delivering this week on writing with AI, =
and what it produced was voicey, confrontational, and difficult to follow. =
It made unsupported claims about my audience and overwrote an earlier file =
without permission. Whereas from the same inputs, <u><a href=3D"https://eve=
ry.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e1=
