Most people are scared of AI right now. They=E2=80=99re afraid it=E2=80=99s=
 going to automate our jobs, atrophy our brains, and steal our data.

Yet there is a small group of humans from around the world who see a =
different future with AI. They are people using AI tools to take on more =
ambitious, more creative, and more interesting human work. But =
they=E2=80=99re scattered across companies and industries, with few =
opportunities to learn from each other.

We want to get them all in one =
place.

That=E2=80=99s why we=E2=80=99re launching our first annual =
conference Thesis, on November 5, 2026, at Pioneer Works in Brooklyn. =
Thesis is a small, intimate event and we=E2=80=99re accepting attendees by =
application. It will also be livestreamed for free for anyone who =
can=E2=80=99t be there in person.

