<hr class=3D"quill-line">
<p></p>
<p>Most people are scared of AI right now. They=E2=80=99re afraid it=E2=80=
=99s going to automate our jobs, atrophy our brains, and steal our data.</p=
>
<p>Yet there is a small group of humans from around the world who see a dif=
ferent future with AI. They are people using AI tools to take on more ambit=
ious, more creative, and more interesting human work. But they=E2=80=99re s=
cattered across companies and industries, with few opportunities to learn f=
rom each other.</p>
<p>We want to get them all in one place.</p>
<p>That=E2=80=99s why we=E2=80=99re launching our first annual conference <=
strong>Thesis</strong>, on November 5, 2026, at Pioneer Works in Brooklyn. =
Thesis is a small, intimate event and we=E2=80=99re accepting attendees by =
application. It will also be livestreamed for free for anyone who can=E2=80=
=99t be there in person.</p>
