<p>China=E2=80=99s advantage is that it can turn a large population into cl=
inical data much faster=E2=80=94and iterate on feedback loops of drug devel=
opment to produce assets that are more effective, and thus more valuable to=
 investors and big pharma. Recently, Legend, a Chinese biotech, developed i=
ts <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fc=
lick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2Fe=
