I=E2=80=99d managed science =
and engineering teams before starting my company, but it was at larger =
companies, where roles, responsibilities, and processes were already =
clearly delineated. Now I was hiring people, defining their roles from =
scratch, and deciding what to hand off when nothing about our sales and =
go-to-market strategies had yet been documented. I had to figure out how to=
