arget=3D"_blank">why faster prototypes don=E2=80=99t make product decisions=
 easier</a></u>. Then, </em><strong><em>Xinran Ma</em></strong><em> shared =
what he unlearned after <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2F=
every.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5e=
