<h2 id=3D"mini-vibe-check-gas-city">Mini-Vibe Check: Gas City</h2>
<h3 id=3D"a-glimpse-of-the-future-thats-not-yet-ready-for-practical-use">A =
glimpse of the future that=E2=80=99s not (yet) ready for practical use </h3=
>
<p>Earlier this year, prominent software engineer <strong><u><a href=3D"htt=
ps://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5eb=
efcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSW5zaWRlIHRoZSAxMDAtYWdlbnQgU29mdHdhcmUgRm=
FjdG9yeSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQyNjYsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL=
3N0ZXZlLXllZ2dlLm1lZGl1bS5jb20vd2VsY29tZS10by1nYXMtdG93bi00ZjI1ZWUxNmRkMDQi=
LCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6Nn0=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Steve=
 Yegge</a></u></strong> published a viral Medium post about <u><a href=3D"h=
ttps://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5=
ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSW5zaWRlIHRoZSAxMDAtYWdlbnQgU29mdHdhcmUg=
RmFjdG9yeSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQyNjYsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczo=
vL3N0ZXZlLXllZ2dlLm1lZGl1bS5jb20vd2VsY29tZS10by1nYXMtdG93bi00ZjI1ZWUxNmRkMD=
QiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6N30=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Gas=
 Town</a></u>, an open-source tool that let developers coordinate 20 to 30 =
AI coding agents in parallel on the same codebase. Last week, Every=E2=80=
=99s head of tech consulting, <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails=
/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJ=
zdWJqZWN0IjoiSW5zaWRlIHRoZSAxMDAtYWdlbnQgU29mdHdhcmUgRmFjdG9yeSIsInBvc3RfaW=
QiOjQyNjYsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL0BtaWtlX=
zIxMTQiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6OH0=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank=
">Mike Taylor</a></u></strong>, got a peek at the future of multi-agent eng=
ineering with Gas Town=E2=80=99s successor project, <u><a href=3D"https://e=
very.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02=
e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSW5zaWRlIHRoZSAxMDAtYWdlbnQgU29mdHdhcmUgRmFjdG9y=
eSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQyNjYsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2dpdGh=
1Yi5jb20vZ2FzdG93bmhhbGwvZ2FzY2l0eSIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjo5fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noope=
ner noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Gas City</a></u>. The project was <u><a h=
ref=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce=
687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSW5zaWRlIHRoZSAxMDAtYWdlbnQgU29m=
dHdhcmUgRmFjdG9yeSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQyNjYsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJ=
odHRwczovL3N0ZXZlLXllZ2dlLm1lZGl1bS5jb20vd2VsY29tZS10by1nYXMtY2l0eS01N2Y1Nj=
RiYjM2MDciLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MTB9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blan=
k">rebuilt as a toolkit</a></u> with Yegge=E2=80=99s blessing by <strong>Ch=
ris Sells, </strong>a long-time developer-tools veteran who grew Google=E2=
=80=99s open-source app-building toolkit, Flutter, to 3 million developers,=
 and former Block technical lead <strong>Julian Knutsen</strong>. Mike join=
ed more than two dozen engineers and chief technology officers who played a=
round with the project at a workshop in New York, with Sells and Knutsen di=
aling in. </p>
<p><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Gas City has some sharp ideas that reflect the d=
irection software development is headed, but it=E2=80=99s not yet ready for=
 prime time. </p>
<p><strong>What is Gas City:</strong> Running many coding agents in paralle=
l is table stakes for developers at this point. Getting them to do anything=
 useful requires coordination systems to hand work to each other, review ea=
ch other=E2=80=99s output, and not step on each other=E2=80=99s branches=E2=
=80=94and nobody=E2=80=99s quite figured out how to get that right yet. =E2=
=80=9CSoftware factories=E2=80=9D like Gas City are one solution: an orches=
tration system that hands tasks to a small team of agents, routes their wor=
k, and decides what=E2=80=99s done. </p>  <div class=3D"ea-block normal">
