 noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">=E2=80=9CThe Unreasonable Effectiveness of H=
TML,=E2=80=9D</a></u> that argued agents should produce single-file HTML in=
stead when they create files. The post hit 4.4 million views in 16 hours. T=
hree days later, <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95=
