<h2 id=3D"inside-every">Inside Every</h2>
<h3 id=3D"working-with-our-agents-in-public">Working with our agents in pub=
lic</h3>
<p>Working well with an agent is a skill new enough that there aren=E2=80=
=99t really best practices yet. So Every=E2=80=99s team has started learnin=
g from each other. </p>
<p>Last week, Every COO <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click=
/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZ=
WN0IjoiSW5zaWRlIHRoZSAxMDAtYWdlbnQgU29mdHdhcmUgRmFjdG9yeSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQy=
NjYsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL29uLWV2ZXJ5L2J=
yYW5kb24tZ2VsbC1qb2lucy1ldmVyeS1hcy1vdXItZmlyc3QtZW50cmVwcmVuZXVyLWluLXJlc2=
lkZW5jZSIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjoyNH0=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_bl=
ank">Brandon Gell</a></u> </strong>and head of marketing <strong>Douglas</s=
trong> <strong>Brundage </strong>each started public channels with their ag=
ents where anyone on the team can observe how they=E2=80=99re working toget=
her. Within 48 hours, a dozen people from across the company had joined to =
lurk.</p>
<p>The idea is that every request that would normally live in a direct mess=
age goes in the channel. Brandon asked the agent to pull a breakdown of whe=
re subscribers are located from Stripe. Douglas asked his to evaluate custo=
mer survey responses against classic marketing frameworks. There was a  41-=
message thread on whether to hook the agent into the <u><a href=3D"https://=
every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc0=
2e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSW5zaWRlIHRoZSAxMDAtYWdlbnQgU29mdHdhcmUgRmFjdG9=
yeSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQyNjYsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZX=
J5LnRvL3RoZXNpcy9jcmVhdGl2ZS13b3JrLWlzLWFib3V0LXRvLWxvb2stYS1sb3QtbW9yZS1sa=
WtlLXByb2dyYW1taW5nIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjI1fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer=
" target=3D"_blank">Flora API</a></u>.</p>
<p>The corrections double as useful material in the channel for learning=E2=
=80=94watching Douglas tell the agent its survey analysis is =E2=80=9Cperfo=
rming research=E2=80=9D rather than =E2=80=9Cmining the results for strateg=
ic clarity=E2=80=9D gives the people watching an understanding of an agent=
=E2=80=99s limitations and hidden assumptions they should look out for in t=
heir own agentic work. Agents can learn from the interactions, too: Brandon=
 has been routing every task through his agent for a week, even the ones he=
 could do faster himself, so it can watch him work and write its own skill =
at the end. For now, the best way to learn how to work with agents may be t=
o watch other people do it.</p>
