most elaborate of these jigs tuned 27 distinct visual variables in the =
story section that explains how a deluge of AI-generated code affects a =
software pipeline=E2=80=94and how OpenAI handles the flood today and is =
making plans for the future. To show the effects of different actions on =
the pipeline, each individual step needed its own camera movements, labels,=
