0019fdda504d8-10688f35-6f72-4182-ae10-58e9476e8cd2-000000/dC2W1y68IvjkvOHr5=
m23mJ_7tR_EL-rqQN3CX9KH6IY=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_bl=
ank">Sign up</a></u> to get it in your inbox.</em></p>
<p></p>
<hr class=3D"quill-line">
<p></p>
<p>One thing I=E2=80=99ve learned as an amateur woodworker is that when a j=
ob is difficult to do precisely=E2=80=94or tedious to do repeatedly=E2=80=
=94you make a jig. A jig, by its broadest definition, is a tool that makes =
it easier to make something else.</p>
<p>If you=E2=80=99re building a bookcase with adjustable shelves, you need =
to drill two straight, evenly spaced rows of holes. If you=E2=80=99re makin=
g a set of drawers, you need to cut the same interlocking joints again and =
again. Jigs make jobs like these simpler, more accurate, or both. They cons=
train the position or movement of a tool or workpiece, making consistent re=
sults less dependent on a steady hand. A shelf-pin jig guides a drill from =
hole to hole; a dovetail jig guides a router through every joint. Jigs can =
be as simple as a block of wood or as elaborate as a custom-built metal gui=
de.</p>
<p>Jigs are also finding their way into AI-assisted interface design. I fir=
st saw the term used in this way by <strong><u><a href=3D"https://icu.every=
.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f4=
54c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiRGVzaWduaW5nIFdpdGg=
gQUk_IE1ha2UgYSBKaWcuIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDQwMiwicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybC=
I6Imh0dHBzOi8vam9zaHB1Y2tldHQubWUvIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjV9/1/0100019fdda504d8-1=
0688f35-6f72-4182-ae10-58e9476e8cd2-000000/gytqx5D96s5QqKRtsSPf-rS5AWYIi66D=
vZM6KXT4ilk=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Josh Pucke=
tt</a></u></strong>, the cofounder of the design studio Iteration and creat=
or of <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%=
2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%=
2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiRGVzaWduaW5nIFdpdGggQUk_IE1ha2UgYSBKaWcuIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6N=
DQwMiwicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vd3d3LmludGVyZmFjZWNyYWZ0=
LmRldi8iLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6Nn0=3D/1/0100019fdda504d8-10688f35-6f72-4182-ae10-5=
8e9476e8cd2-000000/X85okIE9rjqWXFqexf8B9yjI-BLneU48H0CtmryIhLM=3D452" rel=
=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Interface Craft</a></u>, a growi=
ng library of user interaction tools and knowledge. Puckett is also, perhap=
s unsurprisingly, a hobbyist woodworker himself, who sees many similarities=
 between building furniture and building software.</p>
<p>=E2=80=9CTo make more advanced and creative things, you have to make too=
ls to help you make the thing,=E2=80=9D he told me. =E2=80=9CSometimes you=
=E2=80=99re like, ah, God, I need an extra pair of hands. That=E2=80=99s wh=
ere jigs really come into it.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p>Designing and producing Every=E2=80=99s interactive piece <u><a href=3D"=
https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f=
05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiRG=
VzaWduaW5nIFdpdGggQUk_IE1ha2UgYSBKaWcuIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDQwMiwicG9zdF90eXBlI=
joicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vZXZlcnkudG8vcC9vcGVuYWktaW5mcmFzdHJ1Y3R1cmUi=
LCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6N30=3D/1/0100019fdda504d8-10688f35-6f72-4182-ae10-58e9476e8=
cd2-000000/nBgKbViXoI5HCq1asN7qV04Y4jOkMMdOzHowxIXMj5E=3D452" rel=3D"noopen=
er noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">about OpenAI=E2=80=99s infrastructure team=
</a></u> required several jigs to coax the article=E2=80=99s AI-generated c=
ode toward the result we wanted. It would=E2=80=99ve taken too long to prom=
pt my way there=E2=80=94if I was able to at all. Making those tools showed =
me the potential of AI coding agents for designing unique experiences and g=
ave me a new way of thinking about the designer=E2=80=99s role in the midst=
 of increasing automation. Once I made my own jigs, I started seeing them e=
verywhere in AI design tooling.</p>
<h2 id=3D"jigs-in-practice-in-before-the-deluge"><strong>Jigs in practice i=
n =E2=80=98Before the Deluge=E2=80=99</strong></h2>
<p>When it came time to turn <strong><u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0=
/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619e=
