<h2 id=3D"steal-this-workflow">Steal this workflow</h2>
<p>Instead of prompting the specific changes you want on a page or site, as=
k Codex or <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Fem=
ails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966=
