Anthropic=E2=80=99s toolkit for teams developing products with Claude Code.=
 It=E2=80=99s hosted in Headway=E2=80=99s Amazon Web Services environment =
and connected to the company=E2=80=99s tools and data.

Work on Eddy had barely begun six months ago. Headway initially wanted an =
existing product and was preparing to sign a deal with a major AI vendor to=
 give employees access to its desktop app. But relying on vendors to =
deliver features that met Headway=E2=80=99s workflow and strict compliance =
requirements for handling sensitive patient data =E2=80=9Cfelt like we were=
 missing the train,=E2=80=9D says chief technology officer Arnaud Ferreri.

The team=E2=80=99s decision to build its own solution runs counter to the =
