<h3><hr class=3D"quill-line"></h3>
<h2 id=3D"alignment">Alignment </h2>
<p><strong>The expertise trap.</strong> How does arguably the most brillian=
t mathematician of this century use AI? </p>
<p>Quite simply.</p>
<p>I opened <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f0=
5e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiU29tZ=
XRpbWVzIFlvdSBIYXZlIHRvIERlbGV0ZSBFdmVyeXRoaW5nIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDM1NiwicG9z=
dF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vY2hhdGdwdC5jb20vc2hhcmUvNmE1ZmRjN2E=
tZDZmOC04M2U4LWJiZWEtOGRlYjQyY2ZlZDU2IiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjM5fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"n=
oopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Terence Tao</a></u></strong><u><a hre=
f=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce68=
7adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiU29tZXRpbWVzIFlvdSBIYXZlIHRvIERlbG=
V0ZSBFdmVyeXRoaW5nIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDM1NiwicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6I=
mh0dHBzOi8vY2hhdGdwdC5jb20vc2hhcmUvNmE1ZmRjN2EtZDZmOC04M2U4LWJiZWEtOGRlYjQy=
Y2ZlZDU2IiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjQwfQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D=
"_blank">=E2=80=99s conversation with ChatGPT</a></u> about Fable=E2=80=99s=
 counterexample to the notorious <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/clic=
k/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJq=
ZWN0IjoiU29tZXRpbWVzIFlvdSBIYXZlIHRvIERlbGV0ZSBFdmVyeXRoaW5nIiwicG9zdF9pZCI=
6NDM1NiwicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vZXZlcnkudG8vY29udGV4dC=
13aW5kb3cvaG93LWV2ZXJ5LXMtdGVhbS11c2VkLWFpLXRvLXNoaXAtaXRzLWJpZ2dlc3QtbGF1b=
mNoLWV2ZXIiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6NDF9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_bla=
nk">Jacobian conjecture</a></u>, an 87-year-old problem that has long stump=
ed the mathematical community. I half-expected beautiful, elaborate prompts=
 I could steal for my own AI use. Instead, Tao asks short, precise question=
s, dense with mathematical jargon, and pushes the frontier AI model on reas=
oning that doesn=E2=80=99t make sense. It was like watching a 10-year-old g=
enius being schooled by a much older, wiser genius. </p>
<p>I quickly learned that I could copy every prompt Tao used and still neve=
r, not in a million years, reproduce what he did. This sort of mathematical=
 sorcery can only happen when someone has deep knowledge of their craft, be=
cause Tao can do the one thing a non-expert cannot: Evaluate the response. =
Without that expertise, you don=E2=80=99t know whether the answer coming ba=
ck to you is correct or confidently delivered gibberish.</p>
<p>What irritates me is that I fell for the most charlatan-like advice abou=
t =E2=80=9Clearning AI=E2=80=9D from LinkedIn AI influencers who screenshot=
 the latest prompts promising =E2=80=9Coutputs like a McKinsey consultant=
=E2=80=9D or =E2=80=9Cgrowth strategy from a world-class CMO=E2=80=9D=E2=80=
=94as if expertise is just a few sentences you could press the enter key on=
. </p>
<p>It=E2=80=99s so easy to get a seductive answer from AI that I=E2=80=99m =
afraid more and more of us will revert to cognitive offloading and skip the=
 hardship and =E2=80=9Cstuckness=E2=80=9D necessary to develop expertise. I=
n <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454=
c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiU29tZXRpbWVzIFlvdSBIYXZ=
lIHRvIERlbGV0ZSBFdmVyeXRoaW5nIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDM1NiwicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdC=
IsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vd3d3LmFudGhyb3BpYy5jb20vcmVzZWFyY2gvQUktYXNzaXN0YW5jZ=
S1jb2Rpbmctc2tpbGxzIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjQyfQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer=
" target=3D"_blank">Anthropic=E2=80=99s study</a></u> of 52 mostly junior d=
evelopers learning a new Python library, the AI-assisted group scored 50 pe=
rcent on a subsequent quiz, versus 67 percent for those coding by hand. The=
 largest gap between the two groups was in debugging, the skill required to=
 catch the model when it is wrong.</p>
<p>It is a small study, and AI can help people learn. But I now think AI wi=
ll make expertise more valuable and experts harder to produce. </p>
<p>This has irrevocably changed how I use AI. Before reading its answer, I =
force myself to clarify what I already understand. Sometimes I ask, =E2=80=
=9CWhat is a better question here, and why?=E2=80=9D before seeking the ans=
wer. The machine is always ready to rescue me, but watching Tao, I realized=
 expertise is knowing when it hasn=E2=80=99t.=E2=80=94<em><u><a href=3D"htt=
ps://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5eb=
efcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiU29tZXRpbWVzIFlvdSBIYXZlIHRvIERlbGV0ZSBFdm=
VyeXRoaW5nIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDM1NiwicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzO=
i8vd3d3LmdscDFkaWdlc3QuY29tLyIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjo0M30=3D" rel=3D"noopener nore=
ferrer" target=3D"_blank">Ashwin Sharma</a></u></em> </p>
