<p></p>
<hr class=3D"quill-line">
<p></p>
<p>When intelligence is abundant and much of today=E2=80=99s execution can =
be automated, how will humans spend their time at work? What skills will ma=
tter? What kinds of companies will we build? Where will we find meaning, st=
atus, and purpose?</p>
<p>These are the most important questions of our time, and the places we us=
ually turn for answers don=E2=80=99t have them yet.</p>
<p>But there=E2=80=99s a small group of people who do: The humans who are l=
iving with frontier models day in and day out, and applying them to their w=
ork and lives.</p>
<p>That has been our method at Every since the GPT-3 days, when it was not =
yet clear that LLMs were anything more than stochastic parrots. Over the ye=
ars, we=E2=80=99ve argued that AI would <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/=
CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c6=
19eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiV2hhdCBEb2VzIEh1bWFuIFd=
vcmsgTG9vayBMaWtlIEFmdGVyIEF1dG9tYXRpb24_ICIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQ0NDQsInBvc3RfdH=
lwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL2NoYWluLW9mLXRob3VnaHQvdGhlL=
XR3by1zbGljZS10ZWFtIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjZ9/1/010001a01619e8ee-71688f10-7750-4d=
0a-bbe0-124d44262ca4-000000/e2DFxoZGexboSVGKUiNX4siT03U4fClc8oVGj--8S68=3D4=
52" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">let one person</a></u> do=
 work that once required a team, that knowledge workers would become <u><a =
href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c=
3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZW=
N0IjoiV2hhdCBEb2VzIEh1bWFuIFdvcmsgTG9vayBMaWtlIEFmdGVyIEF1dG9tYXRpb24_ICIsI=
nBvc3RfaWQiOjQ0NDQsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRv=
L2NoYWluLW9mLXRob3VnaHQvdGhlLWtub3dsZWRnZS1lY29ub215LWlzLW92ZXItd2VsY29tZS1=
0by10aGUtYWxsb2NhdGlvbi1lY29ub215IiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjd9/1/010001a01619e8ee-71=
688f10-7750-4d0a-bbe0-124d44262ca4-000000/78REOmDms7Qv5nEjB8VFwSjZCgKdGUCuT=
mJHChAtjeQ=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">managers of=
 models</a></u>, and that automation would paradoxically create <u><a href=
=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95=
