<p></p>
<p>One morning in early July, I woke to a flood of alerts from OpenAI and R=
amp: You=E2=80=99re out of credits. Your card has been declined. I began to=
 sweat. At 10 p.m. the night before, our credit balance was full, auto-relo=
ad was on, and our Ramp card had plenty of available funds. Somehow, less t=
han 12 hours later, our account was zeroed out.</p>
<p>That squall turned out to be my brother, Every CEO <strong><a href=3D"ht=
tps://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05=
e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiT3Vy=
IEFJIENvc3RzIEp1bXBlZCAyMzAgUGVyY2VudC4gSeKAmW0gTm90IFNldHRpbmcgVG9rZW4gQnV=
