<p>To handle inbound requests from other people=E2=80=94which could disrupt=
 his own prioritization flow=E2=80=94Dan uses a <u><a href=3D"https://icu.e=
very.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e6=
