<p>The window is open. Google and others have built the infrastructure to r=
un this cycle at scale and put it in the hands of billions. This past week =
mathematicians <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f=
87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiTm90ZXMgRn=
