=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">used a frontier model</a=
></u> to uncover a mathematical secret which had eluded us for 80 years, di=
sproving a long-standing conjecture in discrete geometry. That used to requ=
ire a PhD or a team. Now it can mean one curious person and a coding agent.=
 What=E2=80=99s left is to point these tools at problems worth solving righ=
t now, that produce visible benefits for individuals and communities alike.=
 Announcements like the <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f954=
55f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiT=
