XQuY29tL3IvT3BlbkFJL2NvbW1lbnRzLzF1cnl0NzIvbWF5aGVtX2luX29wZW5haV9hcHBzX3Ro=
ZXlfYXJlX3RyeWluZ190b19tZXJnZS8iLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MjJ9" rel=3D"noopener noref=
errer" target=3D"_blank">=E2=80=9Cmayhem.=E2=80=9D</a></u> The company appe=
ars to have decided that alienating some power users is worth potentially g=
aining a larger audience for Codex: ChatGPT has <u><a href=3D"https://every=
.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e189=
