Perimeter defenses alone are no longer enough; Dan compares them to =
security cameras and guard dogs. Companies need always-on, proactive =
systems that can connect subtle warning signs and contain breaches at =
machine speed. You try to make your systems watertight, and you build pumps=
 for the water that inevitably slips through.

OpenAI and Hugging Face are =
already operating this way, using tactics including classifiers, cyber =
refusals, and defensive agents. Dan sees a world in which frontier labs =
make their agents =E2=80=9Cmore snitchy,=E2=80=9D or likelier to flag each =
other=E2=80=99s suspicious or unexpected behavior=E2=80=94one more tool =
that raises the cost of an attack and buys defenders time.

