      <p><em>Around here, rumors of a good AI workflow spread quickly. As s=
oon as someone shows off their Codex setup, several other people rush to co=
py it=E2=80=94until they realize the setup was built around a person, not a=
 job. You can borrow someone=E2=80=99s ideas but not their workload, their =
brain, or their life.</em></p>
<p><em>Plus: The models the team is driving this week, a workflow for makin=
g data visualizations, and the race for AI coding supremacy heats up even m=
ore. </em></p>
<p><em>Was this newsletter forwarded to you? <u><a href=3D"https://icu.ever=
y.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f=
