<h2 id=3D"signal">Signal</h2>
<p><strong>What happened:</strong> After 16<strong> </strong>years as CEO o=
f Google DeepMind, <strong>Demis Hassabis</strong> is transitioning into a =
new role as chief scientist of Alphabet. <strong>Koray Kavukcuoglu</strong>=
, DeepMind=E2=80=99s CTO, will run the lab as senior vice president, overse=
eing Gemini model development, frontier research, and the Gemini app and de=
veloper teams while Hassabis continues as chairman alongside his chief scie=
ntist role.</p>
<p>Meanwhile, Meta launched Muse Code, its first terminal coding agent, in =
beta yesterday. <strong>Mark Zuckerberg </strong><u><a href=3D"https://icu.=
every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e=
654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiQSBDb2RleCBvZi=
BPbmXigJlzIE93biIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQ0MDEsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InByb21vIiwidXJsIjoia=
HR0cHM6Ly94LmNvbS9maW5rZC9zdGF0dXMvMjA4NTA4MDc1MDAzNDk0MDIwMSIsInBvc2l0aW9u=
Ijo2fQ=3D=3D/1/0100019fd8b48b33-80aa69f1-c859-406c-a782-1e820bebd617-000000=
/OZgTDFmDdsOZyUJ1kXPKwwAZqh37ek6bL3yIew9Fbb8=3D452" rel=3D"noopener norefer=
rer" target=3D"_blank">wrote (on X, ironically)</a></u> that the harness ca=
n tackle =E2=80=9Ccomplete software engineering tasks=E2=80=9D such as plan=
ning, writing, and validating code =E2=80=9Cacross large repos.=E2=80=9D In=
 other words, Claude Code or Codex, but make it Meta. </p>
<p><strong>What it means: </strong>With OpenAI and Anthropic sprinting ahea=
d in the AI coding race, both DeepMind and Meta have some catching up to do=
. CEO <strong><u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2=
Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18=
966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiQSBDb2RleCBvZiBPbmXigJlzIE93biIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQ0M=
DEsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InByb21vIiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9AZGFuc2hpcHBl=
ciIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjo3fQ=3D=3D/1/0100019fd8b48b33-80aa69f1-c859-406c-a782-1e8=
20bebd617-000000/UrTDF8Wm4LS2FgCOo3rVv2ZZIIVWFckZ3bN3PjkKxms=3D452" rel=3D"=
noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Dan Shipper</a></u> </strong><u><a h=
ref=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3=
f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN=
0IjoiQSBDb2RleCBvZiBPbmXigJlzIE93biIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQ0MDEsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6In=
Byb21vIiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly94LmNvbS9kYW5zaGlwcGVyL3N0YXR1cy8yMDg1MDQ4OTkwO=
Dk5MzE1MTQyIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjh9/1/0100019fd8b48b33-80aa69f1-c859-406c-a782-=
1e820bebd617-000000/_ClZleMCSZZdsqSyUGGS5YZGt0XxQfO4SnFA2N2ZO_4=3D452" rel=
=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">saw in the =E2=80=9Ctea leaves=
=E2=80=9D</a></u> that Hassabis =E2=80=9Cbelieves different fundamental res=
earch directions=E2=80=A6are more important to his long-term goal,=E2=80=9D=
 even if they are =E2=80=9Cless [important] competitively today.=E2=80=9D T=
he personnel shift appears to give the company the best of both worlds: a p=
ragmatic play at the most lucrative space in AI today <em>and </em>a bid at=
 looking farther down the road toward AGI. Meta=E2=80=94under pressure foll=
owing a <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femail=
s%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e24=
2%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiQSBDb2RleCBvZiBPbmXigJlzIE93biIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQ0MDEsInB=
vc3RfdHlwZSI6InByb21vIiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuY25iYy5jb20vMjAyNi8wNy8yOS=
9tZXRhLXEyLWVhcm5pbmdzLXJlcG9ydC0yMDI2Lmh0bWwiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6OX0=3D/1/0100=
019fd8b48b33-80aa69f1-c859-406c-a782-1e820bebd617-000000/p23pVNPT9-vxosCkjK=
U_7rIzlmTzVtQZwaRQL8Jto68=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_bla=
nk">lackluster earnings report</a></u> in July=E2=80=94seems to be making a=
 similarly practical decision to go where the revenue is. </p>
<p><strong>What to do: </strong>Adding Meta and a newly re-dedicated DeepMi=
nd to the mix (plus SpaceXAI, which is here, too) brings the total to five =
different frontier labs gunning for our mindshare and token spend. That=E2=
=80=99s either an overwhelming amount of choice, or Christmas has come earl=
y, depending on your perspective. Keep an eye out for reviews from sources =
you trust that can say plainly, and objectively, what is worth a look and w=
hat you can safely skip. Or if you=E2=80=99re feeling spendy, take the new =
models for a spin and become one of those sources yourself. </p>  <div clas=
