rget=3D"_blank">Natalia Quintero</a></u></strong>, compared their Codex set=
ups. =E2=80=9CI find that how people use AI and how they set up their proje=
cts or file systems is a mirror of how they think,=E2=80=9D Natalia says,  =
and she wanted to see how Arielle=E2=80=94who she says is particularly good=
