uts, Arielle sets up reminders and messages =E2=80=9Cso that item can just =
get done without her having to track or pay attention to it,=E2=80=9D accor=
ding to Natalia.  </p>
<p>Even if you borrow tips and tricks from someone else, it=E2=80=99s unlik=
ely that any two Codex setups will look exactly alike. Everyone makes diffe=
rent decisions about what context the agent needs, what it can handle on it=
s own, which tasks deserve a standing process, and when it has to ask permi=
ssion. Seeing someone else=E2=80=99s setup can give you ideas=E2=80=94but i=
