XVzZXMtdGhlaXItY29kaW5nLWFnZW50IiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjIxfQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopene=
r noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Codex</a></u>, using GPT-5.6 Sol on high, i=
s the default reviewer.)</p>
<p>Autoreview played an instrumental role in Naveen=E2=80=99s ability to sh=
ip a new feature for Monologue Notes, which lets people label transcripts a=
s =E2=80=9Cwork,=E2=80=9D =E2=80=9Cpersonal,=E2=80=9D or any other tag, in =
a single nine-hour overnight run. Or more accurately, autoreview is how Fab=
le=E2=80=94with an assist from GPT-5.6 Sol=E2=80=94built the feature across=
 Monologue=E2=80=99s back end, Mac app, iPhone app, and web app for Naveen =
as he slept.</p>
<p>Once Fable was done with the first pass at the code, it ran the autorevi=
ew skill. The skill packaged Fable=E2=80=99s changes and gave them to Codex=
, which returned a list of problems. Fable checked each comment, fixed issu=
es it deemed relevant, then ran autoreview again on the revised code. The p=
rocess repeated over the course of several hours until autoreview unearthed=
