 </p>
<p>It was the first time he merged AI-generated code without asking for maj=
or changes first. Before, he used to review  the code. With autoreview, =E2=
=80=9CCodex replaced me having to find the bugs myself,=E2=80=9D allowing N=
aveen to focus on testing the feature and making sure it aligns with this t=
aste.</p>
