  <div class=3D"post-body">
    <p><strong><em>TL;DR:</em></strong><em> GPT-5.6 is the first model I=E2=
=80=99ve used that can reliably run whole loops of knowledge work, not just=
 help with individual tasks. Your job turns from doing the work to tending =
the system that does it. If you want to try this for yourself, we=E2=80=99r=
e open-sourcing a prompt and repository called </em><strong><em><a href=3D"=
https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f=
05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSG=
