<p><br></p>
<p>Take email. I used to go through my inbox like this: Email comes in, I r=
ead it, I reply, I archive. (Or, email comes in, I open it, I close it, I w=
ait several weeks, I open it again, I archive it.)</p>
<p>With <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femail=
s%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e24=
