 noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Monologue</a></u></strong> to dictate what I=
 want changed. Then I move to the next email.</p>
<p>At the end of each sweep through my inbox, the agent derives my preferen=
ces from my revisions and decisions and remembers them for next time.</p>
<p>It=E2=80=99s no coincidence this sounds like <u><a href=3D"https://icu.e=
very.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e6=
