<h2 id=3D"inside-every"><strong>Inside Every</strong></h2>
<h4 id=3D"the-agents-behind-the-curtain"><strong>The agents behind the curt=
ain</strong></h4>
<p><strong><u>Naveen Naidu</u></strong> is the one-man shop behind <strong>=
<u>Monologue</u></strong>, Every=E2=80=99s smart dictation app.</p>
<p>But Naveen no longer sees it that way=E2=80=94these days, his work feels=
 more like managing a team of engineers.</p>
<p>The engineers just happen to be custom agents he built within <u>Codex</=
u>. On his roster: dedicated engineer agents across different disciplines, =
a customer support agent, and a growth strategist=E2=80=94all of which help=
 maintain the Monologue website and app. Recently, a customer sent Naveen a=
 glowing review that he wanted to feature on Monologue=E2=80=99s website. H=
is customer support agent handed the review text to his web engineer agent,=
 which added the testimonial.</p>
<p>Each agent is a Codex project, complete with a custom <code>AGENTS.md</c=
ode> file, skills, <u>folders</u>, memory, codebases, and additional contex=
t that turns it into a specialist. </p>


