<h4 id=3D"the-24-7-agent-is-nearly-upon-us-or-is-it"><strong>The 24/7 agent=
 is nearly upon us=E2=80=94or is it?</strong></h4>
<p>The <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e65=
4f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIEZhbGxhY3kgb2=
YgdGhlIDE2LWhvdXIgQWdlbnQiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MTkzLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0Iiwid=
XJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9jaGFpbi1vZi10aG91Z2h0L3Rvd2FyZC1hLWRlZmluaXRp=
b24tb2YtYWdpIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjl9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_bl=
ank">holy grail</a></u> of agentic AI has been long-horizon reliability=E2=
=80=94an agent to which you can hand a task and trust to still be on the ri=
ght thread hours later, when context has decayed and there=E2=80=99s no hum=
an in the loop to catch a wrong turn. <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails=
/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJ=
zdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIEZhbGxhY3kgb2YgdGhlIDE2LWhvdXIgQWdlbnQiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MT=
kzLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9tZXRyLm9yZy8iLCJwb3NpdGlvb=
iI6MTB9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">METR</a></u>, a nonp=
rofit that measures AI capabilities, released an update to its research sho=
wing how close we are to that autonomous future. </p>
<p>One chart from the update circulating online shows an early preview of A=
nthropic=E2=80=99s next model, <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/=
7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZW=
N0IjoiVGhlIEZhbGxhY3kgb2YgdGhlIDE2LWhvdXIgQWdlbnQiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MTkzLCJwb=
3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9jb250ZXh0LXdpbmRvdy9l=
