<h3 id=3D"vibe-shift">Vibe shift</h3>
<h4 id=3D"did-opus-4-7-get-better">Did Opus 4.7 get better?</h4>
<p>If you=E2=80=99ve been following <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/=
emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e2=
42/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiT3B1cyA0LjcgUmVlbHMgVXMgQmFjayBJbiIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQyMjgs=
