icG9zaXRpb24iOjZ9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Dan Shippe=
r</a></u></strong>=E2=80=99s posts lately, you know that a large portion of=
 the Every team has been Codex-pilled. When <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/=
emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e2=
42/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiT3B1cyA0LjcgUmVlbHMgVXMgQmFjayBJbiIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQyMjgs=
InBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL3ZpYmUtY2hlY2svZ3B=
0LTUtNSIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjo3fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_b=
lank">GPT-5.5 arrived</a></u>, Codex got so much faster and steadier at cod=
ing and knowledge work that many of us <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/email=
s/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/ey=
JzdWJqZWN0IjoiT3B1cyA0LjcgUmVlbHMgVXMgQmFjayBJbiIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQyMjgsInBvc=
3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL3d3dy55b3V0dWJlLmNvbS93YXRjaD92PXg5=
Qk5CY1BfQzdRIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjh9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_bl=
ank">made the switch</a></u> from Claude Code.</p>
<p>Recently, however, we=E2=80=99ve observed that <u><a href=3D"https://eve=
ry.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e1=
8966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiT3B1cyA0LjcgUmVlbHMgVXMgQmFjayBJbiIsInBvc3RfaWQiOj=
