2svb3B1cy00LTciLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6OX0=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=
=3D"_blank">Opus 4.7</a></u> seems sharper than our initial tests last mont=
h. It proactively suggested that Every engineer <strong><u><a href=3D"https=
://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebef=
cc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiT3B1cyA0LjcgUmVlbHMgVXMgQmFjayBJbiIsInBvc3Rf=
