<h2><strong>=E2=80=98AI &amp; I=E2=80=99: The case against LLMs</strong></h=
2>
<p>Today, we=E2=80=99re releasing a new episode of our podcast <em><a href=
=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687=
adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiTWluaS1WaWJlIENoZWNrOiBDbGF1ZGUgTWF=
uYWdlZCBBZ2VudHMgSGFuZGxlIHRoZSBJbmZyYXN0cnVjdHVyZSBXb3JrIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6ND=
ExMSwicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vZXZlcnkudG8vcG9kY2FzdCIsI=
nBvc2l0aW9uIjo3fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">AI &=
amp; I</a></em>. <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95=
455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0Ijoi=
TWluaS1WaWJlIENoZWNrOiBDbGF1ZGUgTWFuYWdlZCBBZ2VudHMgSGFuZGxlIHRoZSBJbmZyYXN=
0cnVjdHVyZSBXb3JrIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDExMSwicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Im=
h0dHBzOi8vZXZlcnkudG8vQGRhbnNoaXBwZXIiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6OH0=3D" rel=3D"noopen=
er noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Dan Shipper</a></u></strong> sits down wit=
h <strong>Eve Bodnia</strong>, founder and CEO of Logical Intelligence, whi=
ch is developing an alternative AI model to LLMs. They discussed a question=
 most people in AI are afraid to ask: What if LLMs aren=E2=80=99t going to =
be the most powerful form of AI?</p>
<p>Bodnia argues that LLMs have intrinsic weaknesses, notably non-language =
tasks such as spatial reasoning, logical verification, and real-time data a=
nalysis. Her solution: energy-based models (EBMs), which map possible outco=
mes onto a mathematical landscape. Likely outcomes sit in valleys, and unli=
kely ones sit on peaks. Whereas LLMs process one token at a time, an EBM sc=
ans the full terrain to find the lowest point, or the most probable answer.=
 Bodnia argues that it=E2=80=99s this approach, not bigger LLMs, that will =
lead to the next AI phase shift.</p>
<p>Watch on <a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e=
