9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8veW91dHUuYmUvUS1pOFpTVUN0SWMiLCJwb=
3NpdGlvbiI6MTB9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">YouTube</a>,=
 or listen on <a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f8769=
8e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiTWluaS1WaWJlIE=
NoZWNrOiBDbGF1ZGUgTWFuYWdlZCBBZ2VudHMgSGFuZGxlIHRoZSBJbmZyYXN0cnVjdHVyZSBXb=
