<h2><strong>Jagged frontier</strong></h2>
<p><em>Every=E2=80=99s head of platform argues we need new vocabulary for t=
he AI-pilled </em></p>
<p>If you have ever contemplated how to describe the =E2=80=9Camniotic tran=
quility of being indoors during a thunderstorm,=E2=80=9D <em><u><a href=3D"=
https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce=
5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiTWluaS1WaWJlIENoZWNrOiBDbGF1ZGUgTWFuYWd=
