<h2 id=3D"counterpoint"><strong>Counterpoint</strong></h2>
<h4 id=3D"writing-isnt-the-only-way-to-think"><strong>Writing isn=E2=80=99t=
 the only way to think</strong></h4>
<p>Head of tech consulting <strong><u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/h=
ttps:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eaf=
ce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSW4gRGVmZW5zZSBvZiBBSSBXcml0=
aW5nIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDQ0NiwicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vZXZ=
lcnkudG8vQG1pa2VfMjExNCIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjo2fQ=3D=3D/1/010001a02047e1cf-368f7a=
f8-32fd-4bc2-b067-25630beec706-000000/S5ta8GSGZ5in4Bh6Lo84ldysNAZfDuA77_FFz=
SQLjCs=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Mike Taylor</a>=
</u></strong> has regularly used AI in his writing. One of the most popular=
 <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fcli=
ck%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJ=
zdWJqZWN0IjoiSW4gRGVmZW5zZSBvZiBBSSBXcml0aW5nIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDQ0NiwicG9zdF=
90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vZXZlcnkudG8vYWxzby10cnVlLWZvci1odW1hb=
nMvc2V2ZW4tdGhpbmdzLWktdmUtbGVhcm5lZC1nZXR0aW5nLWNvbXBhbmllcy10by11c2UtYWki=
LCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6N30=3D/1/010001a02047e1cf-368f7af8-32fd-4bc2-b067-25630beec=
706-000000/4fOn6YO4NOwXnLt46G3R5Yd-_atMMrPg42KIly76Q-U=3D452" rel=3D"noopen=
er noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">articles</a></u> he=E2=80=99s published on=
 Every was ghostwritten by Claude, as were most of the posts on his <u><a h=
ref=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3=
f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN=
0IjoiSW4gRGVmZW5zZSBvZiBBSSBXcml0aW5nIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDQ0NiwicG9zdF90eXBlIj=
oicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vd3d3LnNheGlmcmFnZS54eXovIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjh9/=
1/010001a02047e1cf-368f7af8-32fd-4bc2-b067-25630beec706-000000/TRYGQUmuBHE3=
YakLICKSQvSPtOzyA0FE6Vz4T1tCcFQ=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=
=3D"_blank">personal blog</a></u>; he revises sections and makes structural=
 edits, but he doesn=E2=80=99t generate the majority of the text himself.</=
p>
<p>This is the kind of admission that makes the internet foam at the mouth.=
 People <em>really</em> hate AI writing. The most common objection is simpl=
e: <u><a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fc=
lick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2Fe=
yJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSW4gRGVmZW5zZSBvZiBBSSBXcml0aW5nIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDQ0NiwicG9z=
dF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vd3d3Lm55dGltZXMuY29tLzIwMjYvMDgvMDQ=
vb3Bpbmlvbi9hcnRpZmljaWFsLWludGVsbGlnZW5jZS1haS13cml0aW5nLmh0bWwiLCJwb3NpdG=
lvbiI6OX0=3D/1/010001a02047e1cf-368f7af8-32fd-4bc2-b067-25630beec706-000000=
/N6gxFBYLO0LseW6__6EzyHiwNeudMPGW24xr0k0t-CI=3D452" rel=3D"noopener norefer=
rer" target=3D"_blank">Writing is thinking</a></u>. If you outsource the dr=
afting process to an LLM, you have outsourced the reasoning and judgment cr=
itical to forming an original idea.<em> Of course</em> the result is slop. =
Stop wasting everyone=E2=80=99s time. But it=E2=80=99s not always that simp=
le: Having something compelling to say doesn=E2=80=99t make you a great wri=
ter, just as being a great writer doesn=E2=80=99t necessarily mean you have=
 something compelling to say.</p>
<p>Mike is the first to admit he=E2=80=99s more of a doer than a writer. He=
=E2=80=99s out in the world, teaching executives how to use AI at their org=
anizations to get work done. He also tests new models before they are relea=
sed and is currently building an evaluation set to automate CEO <strong><u>=
<a href=3D"https://icu.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2=
F7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJ=
qZWN0IjoiSW4gRGVmZW5zZSBvZiBBSSBXcml0aW5nIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDQ0NiwicG9zdF90eX=
BlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vZXZlcnkudG8vQGRhbnNoaXBwZXIiLCJwb3NpdGlvb=
iI6MTB9/1/010001a02047e1cf-368f7af8-32fd-4bc2-b067-25630beec706-000000/swpr=
reL349wuZmBkoh3sov02UHXElyHMn_bSqXMNRDA=3D452" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" =
target=3D"_blank">Dan Shipper</a></u></strong>=E2=80=99s judgment. </p>
<p>Mike would never prompt an AI to write about an A/B test he didn=E2=80=
=99t perform himself. =E2=80=9CBut if I=E2=80=99ve run the test, I think it=
=E2=80=99s completely valid for me to go to an AI and say, =E2=80=98I ran a=
 test. Here=E2=80=99s what I did and how,=E2=80=99=E2=80=9D he says. He=E2=
=80=99ll dictate everything, from setup to results, and then use AI to form=
at it all into a post.</p>
<p>The process shrinks a full day of writing down to two hours and gets wha=
t he=E2=80=99s learned in front of more people more often. That=E2=80=94not=
 beautiful prose=E2=80=94is the goal. (For the record, Mike also loathes po=
sts where it=E2=80=99s clear the author didn=E2=80=99t bother to review wha=
t AI spat out; those two hours of his time include reading and revising.)</=
p>
<p>As a reader, he prioritizes functionality over style. =E2=80=9CIf you pu=
t this strict cap on it=E2=80=94=E2=80=98You have to be a good writer to ge=
t your ideas out=E2=80=99=E2=80=94you miss almost all of the interesting th=
ings happening in the world,=E2=80=9D he says.</p>
