<p>Another issue is what, exactly, the watermark proves when there are many=
 mitigating factors and edge cases. Anthropic says AI detection doesn=E2=80=
=99t work well on small samples and factual passages that contain precise l=
anguage. Heavy editing can weaken or remove the signal, and the watermark c=
an=E2=80=99t identify AI-generated text from another model. </p>
<p><strong>What it means. </strong>Mike=E2=80=99s <u><a href=3D"https://icu=
.every.to/CL0/https:%2F%2Fevery.to%2Femails%2Fclick%2F7c3f95455f05e60f87698=
e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242%2FeyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSW4gRGVmZW5zZ=
