r noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">initial fear</a></u> that the current water=
mark would make Claude=E2=80=99s writing worse dissipated after he investig=
ated how SynthID Text works. </p>
<p>He is still worried that the watermark will be treated as a way to stigm=
atize AI-assisted work, even though it can=E2=80=99t show how Claude was us=
ed=E2=80=94or how much human judgment went into the result. Meanwhile, user=
s who provide detailed prompts, edit AI-generated text, or run outputs thro=
