<p></p>
<p>Frontier models usually take a while to get used to. You have to learn t=
heir slow spots, when they need extra prompting, and when to keep a close e=
ye on the output.</p>
<p><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c6=
19eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVmliZSBDaGVjazogR1BULTUuN=
