2fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">GPT-5.5</a>, out t=
oday, feels easier to settle into. It=E2=80=99s fast enough to use constant=
ly, personable enough to collaborate with, and assertive enough to carry a =
plan through serious engineering work. It=E2=80=99s better at writing than =
any OpenAI model we=E2=80=99ve used in about a year, and it produced the st=
rongest result we=E2=80=99ve seen on our new Senior Engineer Benchmark, whi=
ch measures how well models can rewrite a messy production codebase the way=
 a senior engineer would. It=E2=80=99s rare for a model to feel easier and =
stronger at the same time.</p>
<p>The <a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f4=
54c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVmliZSBDaGVjazogR1BUL=
