>GPT-5.5</a></u> on May 5 at 5:55 p.m., a time chosen by the model itself. =
The following day Anthropic held its second annual <u><a href=3D"https://ev=
ery.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e=
