r" target=3D"_blank">Sign up</a></u> to get it in your inbox.</em></p>
<p></p>
<hr class=3D"quill-line">
<p></p>
<p>To our surprise, the biggest launch from Anthropic=E2=80=99s <u><a href=
=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687=
adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSW5zaWRlIEFudGhyb3BpY-KAmXMgMjAyNiB=
EZXZlbG9wZXIgQ29uZmVyZW5jZSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQxODksInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLC=
J1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2NsYXVkZS5jb20vY29kZS13aXRoLWNsYXVkZSIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjo4f=
Q=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">developer conference=
</a></u> in San Francisco yesterday wasn=E2=80=99t a model or a feature. In=
stead, it was the company=E2=80=99s announcement of <u><a href=3D"https://e=
very.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02=
e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSW5zaWRlIEFudGhyb3BpY-KAmXMgMjAyNiBEZXZlbG9wZXIg=
Q29uZmVyZW5jZSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQxODksInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHR=
wczovL3d3dy5hbnRocm9waWMuY29tL25ld3MvaGlnaGVyLWxpbWl0cy1zcGFjZXgiLCJwb3NpdG=
lvbiI6OX0=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">a deal with Spa=
ceX</a></u> to allocate all of the capacity in the latter=E2=80=99s Colossu=
s supercluster to Claude.</p>
<p>Anthropic has been riding a historic demand surge over the last year as =
Claude Code opened up a new wave of agentic coding for engineers and non-en=
gineers alike. But compute constraints have caused friction even amongst it=
s most die-hard fans=E2=80=94we=E2=80=99ve written previously about <u><a h=
ref=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce=
687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSW5zaWRlIEFudGhyb3BpY-KAmXMgMjAy=
NiBEZXZlbG9wZXIgQ29uZmVyZW5jZSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQxODksInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3Q=
iLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL2NvbnRleHQtd2luZG93L2dldC15b3VyLWhhbmRzLW=
RpcnR5I3NpZ25hbCIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjoxMH0=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" targe=
t=3D"_blank">being frustrated</a></u> with its OpenClaw restrictions and th=
e speed of its latest models like <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/cli=
ck/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJ=
qZWN0IjoiSW5zaWRlIEFudGhyb3BpY-KAmXMgMjAyNiBEZXZlbG9wZXIgQ29uZmVyZW5jZSIsIn=
Bvc3RfaWQiOjQxODksInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL=
3ZpYmUtY2hlY2svb3B1cy00LTciLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MTF9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer=
" target=3D"_blank">Opus 4.7</a></u>.</p>
<p>The deal with SpaceX changes that equation. Anthropic has already double=
d rate limits for subscription plans, removed peak-hour limits on Pro and M=
ax accounts, and raised API rate limits by as much as almost 17 times for c=
ertain tiers.</p>
<p>Other than that, the big story is Claude Managed Agents, Anthropic=E2=80=
=99s hosted agent product. The company released <u><a href=3D"https://every=
=2Eto/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f8769=
8e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e189=
66e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSW5zaWRlIEFudGhyb3BpY-KAmXMgMjAyNiBEZXZlbG9wZXIgQ29u=
ZmVyZW5jZSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQxODksInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczo=
vL2NsYXVkZS5jb20vYmxvZy9uZXctaW4tY2xhdWRlLW1hbmFnZWQtYWdlbnRzIiwicG9zaXRpb2=
4iOjEyfQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">three new fea=
tures</a></u>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Multi-agent orchestration:</strong> a coordinator agent that spins =
up subagents in parallel baked into the platform</li>
<li>
<strong>Dreaming:</strong> Anthropic=E2=80=99s general-purpose version of <=
u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c61=
9eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSW5zaWRlIEFudGhyb3BpY-KAmX=
MgMjAyNiBEZXZlbG9wZXIgQ29uZmVyZW5jZSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQxODksInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6I=
nBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL2d1aWRlcy9jb21wb3VuZC1lbmdpbmVlcmlu=
ZyIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjoxM30=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">c=
ompound engineering</a></u>, a feature that allows agents to learn from pas=
t sessions to improve between runs</li>
<li>
<strong>Outcomes:</strong> Anthropic=E2=80=99s answer to Codex=E2=80=99s /g=
oals command, allowing developers to specify an outcome and run an agent in=
 a loop until the outcome is achieved</li>
</ul>
<p>By themselves, these features are nice but not groundbreaking. What=E2=
=80=99s more important  is that <em>what an AI platform is</em> has changed=
=2E In the GPT-3 days, the platform was=
 a text completion end-point: Send tex=
t in, get text out. Now, with Claude Managed Agents, the platform is an AI =
model with a harness and host computer=E2=80=94all provided with unlimited =
scaling by the model companies.</p>
<p><strong><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e6=
54f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSW5zaWRlIEFudGhyb=
3BpY-KAmXMgMjAyNiBEZXZlbG9wZXIgQ29uZmVyZW5jZSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQxODksInBvc3Rf=
dHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2NvcmEuY29tcHV0ZXIiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MTR=
9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Cora</a> </strong>general =
manager<strong> <a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87=
698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSW5zaWRlIEFu=
dGhyb3BpY-KAmXMgMjAyNiBEZXZlbG9wZXIgQ29uZmVyZW5jZSIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQxODksInB=
vc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL0BraWVyYW5fMTM1NSIsIn=
Bvc2l0aW9uIjoxNX0=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Kieran =
Klaassen</a></strong> and I reported live from conference with our biggest =
takeaways, including the xAI compute deal, doubled Claude usage limits, Cla=
ude Managed Agents, and why the battle lines between OpenAI and Anthropic a=
re starting to become clearer. Watch now:</p>
