alls, or on walks=E2=80=94and then disappears. <strong>Monologue Notes</str=
ong>, out today, records and transcribes all of it=E2=80=94the calls, meeti=
ngs, and voice memos=E2=80=94and makes it available to the same agents and =
tools you use every day. It makes the thinking that happens in conversation=
s and on walks just as actionable as the work you do at your desk.</p>
<p>Notes is available through the <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/em=
ails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242=
/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSW50cm9kdWNpbmcgTW9ub2xvZ3VlIE5vdGVzOiBSZWNvcmQgRXZlcnkgTW=
