noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Monologue</a></u></strong> app on Ma=
c, iOS, and WatchOS and syncs across all your Apple devices. You can start =
a recording on your Apple Watch before you leave the house, keep your phone=
 in your pocket the entire time you=E2=80=99re outside, and pull the note i=
nto Codex once you=E2=80=99re back at your computer.</p>
