Hi there,

Most products we build at Every are the result of pain that the
team is feeling. Case in point: Our own desktops were graveyards
of screenshots, drafts, decks, and PDFs. We built Sparkle so you
never face that chaos again.

Sparkle organizes your folders the way you want them, and it
cleans up the clutter that's been quietly taking over your Mac.

Point it at a folder, describe how you like things organized, and
Sparkle builds a structure around that. New files get sorted as
they arrive. Old installers, system junk, and forgotten
screenshots get flagged for cleanup. And it all runs in the
background, on a schedule you set.

