<h5 id=3D"spiral-lets-you-browse-and-restore-old-draft-versions"><strong>Sp=
iral lets you browse and restore old draft versions</strong></h5>
<p>Spiral added version history=E2=80=94you can now see how a draft evolved=
 and roll back to an earlier version with one click. It also shipped two li=
ghtweight API endpoints for quick rewrites and made the onboarding flow not=
iceably smoother. </p>
<h5 id=3D"coras-inbox-has-stars-voice-dictation-and-a-smoother-compose-box"=
><strong>Cora=E2=80=99s inbox has stars, voice dictation, and a smoother co=
mpose box</strong></h5>
<p>Cora=E2=80=99s inbox got a round of usability upgrades: a starred view f=
or important threads, typed snooze durations, voice dictation, and a smooth=
er compose experience. The app is also faster behind the scenes. Kieran is =
looking for a small group of alpha testers to help pressure-test the full i=
nbox=E2=80=94if you=E2=80=99re interested, reach out to him at <u><a href=
