mlsbHMtZm9yLXV0YWgtcGF0aWVudHMvIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjQ0fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopene=
r noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">pilot is safe</a></u>, the first 250 AI ren=
ewals are reviewed by a physician before anything reaches a pharmacy, and t=
he AI has to agree with that physician more than 98 percent of the time bef=
ore it can proceed independently. The next 1,000 renewals are then reviewed=
