  <div class=3D"post-body">
    <p><em>Not every step in an AI workflow needs the smartest AI. That may=
 sound obvious, but it=E2=80=99s not how most people are working. The defau=
lt is to route entire tasks through frontier models, which is expensive, sl=
ow, and usually unnecessary. Incremental determinism starts from a differen=
t question: How much intelligence does this task really need?? The answer i=
s almost always less than you=E2=80=99d expect, and the savings add up.=E2=
=80=94<u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654=
f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiWW91IEFyZSB0aGUgTW9=
