JsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9AbWlrZV8yMTE0IiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjV9" rel=3D"noop=
ener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Mike Taylor</a></u></em></p>
<p></p>
<hr class=3D"quill-line">
<p></p>
<p>There is a reason McDonald=E2=80=99s would never ask its CEO to man the =
burger grill: It would cost the company <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emai=
ls/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/e=
