<p></p>
<p>Anthropic surprised us yesterday by dropping <a href=3D"https://every.to=
/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e=
242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVmliZSBDaGVjazogT3B1cyA0LjcgU3RvcHBlZCBSZWFkaW5nIEJldHd=
