h0dHBzOi8vZXZlcnkudG8vdmliZS1jaGVjay9vcHVzLTQtNyIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjo2fQ=3D=3D"=
 rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Opus 4.7</a>=E2=80=94so we d=
id what we do: We went live on X and YouTube with five testers and figured =
it out in front of 10,000 people. Anthropic researcher <strong><u><a href=
=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687=
adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVmliZSBDaGVjazogT3B1cyA0LjcgU3RvcHB=
