errer" target=3D"_blank">stream</a></u> to explain what had changed. Two ho=
urs of live testing and an afternoon in Slack later, here=E2=80=99s the sho=
rt version: <strong>This model rewards people who write tight prompts and f=
rustrates everyone who doesn=E2=80=99t.</strong> Here=E2=80=99s our <a href=
=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687=
adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVmliZSBDaGVjazogT3B1cyA0LjcgU3RvcHB=
