<h5><strong>Cora=E2=80=99s new inbox is looking for alpha testers</strong><=
/h5>
<p>Kieran is looking for a small group of alpha testers to put Cora=E2=80=
=99s new inbox experience through its paces and share feedback. The alpha v=
ersion now supports drafts, snooze, grouped views, keyboard shortcuts, meta=
data parsing, bulk archive, undo, and a context-aware chat that can answer =
questions about the email you already have open. </p>
<p>Cora=E2=80=99s broader goal is to let people do email however they want,=
 whether that means organizing  by recency, categories, briefs, or eventual=
ly doing an agent-first pass with manual cleanup at the end. If you want ac=
cess, reach out to Kieran at kieran@every.to.</p>
