    <p><strong><em>Noah Brier</em></strong><em> cofounded Percolate in 2011=
 and learned the CEO=E2=80=99s hardest job: keeping a whole company pointed=
 in the same direction. Now, at his AI consultancy</em> <em><u><a href=3D"h=
ttps://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5=
