<h2 id=3D"the-alignment-problem-isnt-new-and-ai-didnt-solve-it">The alignme=
nt problem isn=E2=80=99t new=E2=80=94and AI didn=E2=80=99t solve it</h2>
<p>I ran into this alignment problem years ago, when I cofounded the compan=
y Percolate, a content marketing platform, in 2011. As we grew the business=
 from zero to 100 people in less than three years, my job as CEO shifted fr=
om building the product to building a company capable of building the produ=
ct. My agents were people, and my job was to design the system they worked =
within. Culture, I concluded, was one of the strongest levers I had.</p>
<p>As <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f8=
7698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIEN1bHR=
1cmUgb2YgQUkgRW5naW5lZXJpbmciLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MTkwLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0Ii=
widXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly93d3cud2VsY29tZXRvdGhlanVuZ2xlLmNvbS9lbi9hcnRpY2xlcy9iZ=
W4taG9yb3dpdHotY3VsdHVyZS1jb3Jwb3JhdGUtYm9vayIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjoxOH0=3D" rel=
=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Ben Horowitz</a></u></strong><u>=
<a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619e=
afce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIEN1bHR1cmUgb2YgQUkgRW5n=
aW5lZXJpbmciLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MTkwLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM=
6Ly93d3cud2VsY29tZXRvdGhlanVuZ2xlLmNvbS9lbi9hcnRpY2xlcy9iZW4taG9yb3dpdHotY3=
VsdHVyZS1jb3Jwb3JhdGUtYm9vayIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjoxOX0=3D" rel=3D"noopener noref=
errer" target=3D"_blank"> put it</a></u>, culture is =E2=80=9Chow your comp=
any makes decisions when you=E2=80=99re not there.=E2=80=9D This was exactl=
y what I needed: documents, tools, and rituals that helped each individual =
make the best possible decision without having to run every decision up the=
 chain. I probably spent half my time on this, building a <a href=3D"https:=
//every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefc=
c02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIEN1bHR1cmUgb2YgQUkgRW5naW5lZXJpbmciLCJwb=
3N0X2lkIjo0MTkwLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9yZXZpZXcuZmly=
c3Ryb3VuZC5jb20vdGhpcy1zdGFydHVwLWJ1aWx0LWludGVybmFsLXRvb2xzLXRvLWZ1ZWwtbWF=
qb3ItZ3Jvd3RoLWhlcmVzLXRoZWlyLWFwcHJvYWNoLyIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjoyMH0=3D" rel=3D=
"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">living culture document</a>, runnin=
g onboarding sessions for every new hire, and developing <a href=3D"https:/=
/every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc=
02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIEN1bHR1cmUgb2YgQUkgRW5naW5lZXJpbmciLCJwb3=
N0X2lkIjo0MTkwLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9yZXZpZXcuZmlyc=
3Ryb3VuZC5jb20vdGhpcy1zdGFydHVwLWJ1aWx0LWludGVybmFsLXRvb2xzLXRvLWZ1ZWwtbWFq=
b3ItZ3Jvd3RoLWhlcmVzLXRoZWlyLWFwcHJvYWNoLyIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjoyMX0=3D" rel=3D"=
noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">internal tools</a> that automaticall=
y routed knowledge to the right people.</p>
<p>Every new technology promises to solve these coordination problems. But =
of course, nothing is that simple. What they do in reality is reshape the l=
andscape around them and, in the process, create new problems that didn=E2=
=80=99t exist before. AI is no different.  </p>
<p>Open-source software offers an early glimpse of the kind of unexpected p=
roblems that AI can create: Whereas the primary challenge a few years ago w=
as finding maintainers willing to contribute code on goodwill alone, today=
=E2=80=99s challenge is sifting through hundreds of crappy <u><a href=3D"ht=
tps://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5e=
befcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIEN1bHR1cmUgb2YgQUkgRW5naW5lZXJpbmciL=
CJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MTkwLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ib3Jpc3Rh=
bmUuY29tL2Jsb2cvc2xvcC1jcmVlcC1lbnNoaXR0aWZpY2F0aW9uLW9mLXNvZnR3YXJlLyIsInB=
vc2l0aW9uIjoyMn0=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">AI-gener=
ated pull requests flooding GitHub</a></u>. </p>
<p>Now, 15 years later, my audience at <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/email=
s/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/ey=
JzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIEN1bHR1cmUgb2YgQUkgRW5naW5lZXJpbmciLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MTkwL=
CJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cDovL2FsZXBoaWMuY29tIiwicG9zaXRpb24i=
OjIzfQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Alephic</a></u>=
 is not just the humans who work with me. Those humans are often paired wit=
h agents, and, increasingly, the agents themselves are delivering work inde=
pendently. Yet the core problem is identical. </p>
<p>If you=E2=80=99ve used a coding agent for more than a week, you=E2=80=99=
ve already experienced this: The code works, but it often feels written by =
someone most definitely not you=E2=80=94ignoring obvious abstractions and s=
tylistic norms that are present in the codebase. It looks, in other words, =
like a new engineer on the team who hasn=E2=80=99t been properly onboarded.=
 We write onboarding documents and do training for our human colleagues, bu=
t most people don=E2=80=99t do this for agents. Yet.</p>
<h2 id=3D"pace-layers-of-ai-engineering">Pace layers of AI engineering </h2=
>
<p>I still have an onboarding document and set of activities every new hire=
 goes through during their first week, including building a module in our h=
omegrown learning system as their first coding task (a few recent editions =
were GPUs, <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f8769=
8e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIEN1bHR1cm=
Ugb2YgQUkgRW5naW5lZXJpbmciLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MTkwLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0Iiwid=
XJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9odWdnaW5nZmFjZS5jby9kb2NzL29wdGltdW0vY29uY2VwdF9ndWlkZXMv=
cXVhbnRpemF0aW9uIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjI0fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" t=
arget=3D"_blank">quantization</a></u>, and <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/e=
mails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e24=
2/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIEN1bHR1cmUgb2YgQUkgRW5naW5lZXJpbmciLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0M=
TkwLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9kZXZlbG9wZXJzLm9wZW5haS5j=
b20vY29tbWVyY2UiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MjV9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D=
"_blank">agentic commerce protocols</a></u>).</p>
<p>But I am also building tools that go further and ensuring our code is ma=
intainable, consistent, and built the way we=E2=80=99d want it built. </p>
<p>I think about our tooling as a kind of cultural stack, where standards i=
nform architectures, which in turn inform specs, plans, and code. The layer=
s are inspired by counterculture systems thinker <strong><u><a href=3D"http=
s://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebe=
fcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIEN1bHR1cmUgb2YgQUkgRW5naW5lZXJpbmciLCJ=
wb3N0X2lkIjo0MTkwLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9qb2RzLm1pdH=
ByZXNzLm1pdC5lZHUvcHViL2lzc3VlMy1icmFuZC9yZWxlYXNlLzIiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MjZ9"=
 rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Stewart Brand</a></u></stron=
g><u>=E2=80=98<a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f8769=
8e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIEN1bHR1cm=
Ugb2YgQUkgRW5naW5lZXJpbmciLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MTkwLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0Iiwid=
XJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9qb2RzLm1pdHByZXNzLm1pdC5lZHUvcHViL2lzc3VlMy1icmFuZC9yZWxl=
YXNlLzIiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6Mjd9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank"=
>s pace layers framework</a></u>. It=E2=80=99s a model for how society chan=
ges at different speeds, from nature, which shifts over millennia, to fashi=
on, which can change by the day. The lower layers move slowly; the upper on=
es move fast.</p>
