  <div class=3D"post-body">
    <p><em>Was this newsletter forwarded to you? <u><a href=3D"https://ever=
y.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18=
966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSSBMZXQgQ2hhdEdQVCBNYW5hZ2UgTXkgV29ya3dlZWsiLCJwb3N=
0X2lkIjo0MTUzLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9hY2=
NvdW50IiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjV9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">S=
ign up</a></u> to get it in your inbox.</em></p>
<p></p>
<hr class=3D"quill-line">
<p></p>
<p>I sat down to write my second-quarter goals at 4:30 p.m. on a Tuesday in=
 early April. It was the day after I was supposed to turn them in when I de=
cided to be an adult and survey the damage from the first quarter. And I do=
 mean damage. I=E2=80=99d written only half of the columns I=E2=80=99d comm=
itted to. Another project I had promised hadn=E2=80=99t even gotten off the=
 ground. </p>
<p>I could give the usual excuses=E2=80=94the quarter was busy, the project=
 hit walls outside my control=E2=80=94but the real culprit was obvious: I m=
ay be a great writer, but I am garbage at project management.</p>
<p>For 15 years, I handled this weakness by tiptoeing around it. I didn=E2=
=80=99t take on managerial roles that would have required more organization=
al skills. I didn=E2=80=99t take on so much freelance work that I couldn=E2=
=80=99t keep the deadlines in my head. I passed on ambitious projects=E2=80=
=94too many moving parts. </p>
<p>This duct-taped approach worked until I decided to join Every full-time =
in April. If I were going to take on more responsibility as a full member o=
f the team, I needed to get serious about project management. Which, in 202=
6, meant I needed to bring in AI.  </p>
<p>So I built myself a project manager: a ChatGPT agent that holds my OKRs=
=E2=80=94<u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e=
654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiSSBMZXQgQ2hhdEdQ=
VCBNYW5hZ2UgTXkgV29ya3dlZWsiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MTUzLCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0Iiw=
idXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9zb3VyY2UtY29kZS9ob3ctd2UtcnVuLWEtMjUtcGVyc2=
9uLWNvbXBhbnktb24tZm91ci1haS1hZ2VudHMiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6Nn0=3D" rel=3D"noopen=
er noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">objectives and key results</a></u>, the go=
als that define a successful quarter=E2=80=94watches my calendar, reads my =
Notion to-do list, and helps me decide what to do next. Otherwise, I=E2=80=
=99d spend my day opening Slack, refreshing X, panicking lightly, repeat.</=
p>
