jZS1hZ2VudHMtaW4tY2hhdGdwdC8iLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MjJ9" rel=3D"noopener noreferr=
er" target=3D"_blank">ChatGPT agent</a></u> builder, which you can find in =
the left-hand sidebar of the ChatGPT web app. Then I explained, in plain En=
glish, what I wanted: a project-management agent that would help me organiz=
