<h2 id=3D"spotlight"><strong>Spotlight</strong></h2>
<h4 id=3D"noah-brier-ai-entrepreneur-and-seer"><strong><u><a href=3D"https:=
//every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefc=
c02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiTWluaW5nIFlvdXIgTGlmZSBmb3IgQ29udGV4dCAiLCJwb=
