=3D"_blank">agent-native architecture</a></u> became practical about four m=
onths ago, when the Claude Code SDK became available. Before that, you coul=
d approximate the ability to have an agent move and delete files through a =
chat window, but building it safely was much harder.</p>
<p>We=E2=80=99ve also found a way to create sophisticated file systems whil=
e balancing speed and cost. Sparkle starts by analyzing a sub-section of yo=
ur recent files with <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f=
