 sign off on the folder structure, classifying new files into the folders y=
ou=E2=80=99ve defined doesn=E2=80=99t require heavy AI lifting: A file call=
ed =E2=80=9CQ1 invoice.pdf=E2=80=9D goes into =E2=80=9CFinance,=E2=80=9D a =
contract goes into =E2=80=9CLegal,=E2=80=9D an audio file goes into =E2=80=
