<h2>Now, next, nixed</h2>
<h4>Developer UI</h4>
<p><strong>Now:</strong> Anthropic gave Claude Code=E2=80=99s desktop app a=
 redesign, adding a sidebar for managing sessions, drag-and-drop panes, and=
 an integrated terminal and file editor. Altogether, it makes it easier to =
work multiple projects in parallel. <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/=
emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e2=
