<p><strong>Next:</strong> Claude Code=E2=80=99s refreshed look is not exact=
ly original, says <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f9=
5455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0Ijo=
