=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">write more rigorously</a></u>, r=
esearch more thoroughly, and take on projects far beyond what I used to <u>=
<a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619e=
afce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiV2UgTmVlZCB0byBUYWxrIEFib3V0=
