L3RoaXMtcHJvbXB0LW9wdGltaXplci1sZWFybnMtZnJvbS1pdHMtbWlzdGFrZXMtbGlrZS1kbmE=
iLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MTl9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">better=
 prompting</a></u>, <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f0=
5e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiV2UgT=
mVlZCB0byBUYWxrIEFib3V0IEFJIEF1dG9waWxvdCIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQxMTcsInBvc3RfdHlw=
ZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL3ZpYmUtY2hlY2svb3B1cy00LTciLCJ=
wb3NpdGlvbiI6MjB9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">better mod=
els</a></u>, <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87=
698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiV2UgTmVlZCB0=
byBUYWxrIEFib3V0IEFJIEF1dG9waWxvdCIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQxMTcsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InB=
vc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL3AveW91ci1iZXN0LWFpLXN0cmF0ZWd5LXN0YX=
J0cy1hdC10aGUtdG9wIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjIxfQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer"=
 target=3D"_blank">better workflows</a></u>, and <u><a href=3D"https://ever=
y.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18=
966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiV2UgTmVlZCB0byBUYWxrIEFib3V0IEFJIEF1dG9waWxvdCIsInB=
vc3RfaWQiOjQxMTcsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2V2ZXJ5LnRvL3=
NvdXJjZS1jb2RlL3RoZS1mb2xkZXItaXMtdGhlLWFnZW50IiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjIyfQ=3D=3D"=
 rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">better agents</a></u>. We ta=
lk less about the moments when we should slow down=E2=80=94because that=E2=
=80=99s uncomfortable and hard. In 2021, researchers <u><a href=3D"https://=
every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc0=
2e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiV2UgTmVlZCB0byBUYWxrIEFib3V0IEFJIEF1dG9waWxvdCI=
sInBvc3RfaWQiOjQxMTcsInBvc3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2RvaS5vcm=
cvMTAuMTE0NS8zNDQ5Mjg3IiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjIzfQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener norefer=
rer" target=3D"_blank">tested ways to reduce overreliance on AI</a></u>. Th=
e interventions that worked best were =E2=80=9Ccognitive forcing functions,=
=E2=80=9D designs that made people form their own judgment before seeing or=
 accepting the AI=E2=80=99s answer.</p>
<p>Those same interventions <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3=
f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0I=
joiV2UgTmVlZCB0byBUYWxrIEFib3V0IEFJIEF1dG9waWxvdCIsInBvc3RfaWQiOjQxMTcsInBv=
c3RfdHlwZSI6InBvc3QiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL2RvaS5vcmcvMTAuMTE0NS8zNDQ5Mjg3Iiw=
icG9zaXRpb24iOjI0fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">al=
so got the worst ratings from users</a></u>. People did not like being made=
 to think first. Of course, they didn=E2=80=99t. The whole appeal of automa=
tion is that it reduces effort. A tool that says, =E2=80=9CBefore I help yo=
u, please do the hard part yourself for a minute=E2=80=9D feels like a spee=
d bump. But speed bumps are the solution to autopilot. </p>
<h2><strong>What I am trying instead</strong></h2>
<p>My solution to autopilot is not to give up AI and return to some imagine=
d golden age where I nobly suffer in a blank Google Doc. But I <em>am </em>=
making some changes to how I process and finalize work to curb the tendency=
 to ship now, think later. </p>
<h4>Change 1: Think before you look </h4>
<p>Before I ask AI for a draft, I try to write down my own rough position. =
It=E2=80=99s not the polished version or a full argument. Sometimes it is o=
nly five bullets=E2=80=94some combination of what I think, what I know, wha=
t I am unsure about, what I refuse to say, and what would make the piece us=
eful. Then, when the model gives me an output, I have something to compare =
it against besides vibes.</p>
