er noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">agent swarms</a></u> work.</p>
<p>The idea of multiplying myself by coordinating multiple agents at the sa=
me time was a compelling pitch as the sole engineer building Every=E2=80=99=
s AI email assistant, <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7=
