> where a lead agent managed a pool of workers. Many iterations, many burne=
d tokens.</p>
<p>But more agents didn=E2=80=99t make me faster. I=E2=80=99ve <u><a href=
=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687=
adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIEZvbGRlciBJcyB0aGUgQWdlbnQgIiw=
