0=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">skill</a></u> definitio=
ns, and context accumulated through months of <u><a href=3D"https://every.t=
o/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966=
e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIEZvbGRlciBJcyB0aGUgQWdlbnQgIiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDEwOC=
wicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vZXZlcnkudG8vc291cmNlLWNvZGUvY=
29tcG91bmQtZW5naW5lZXJpbmctdGhlLWRlZmluaXRpdmUtZ3VpZGUiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MTl9=
" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">compound engineering</a></u=
>=E2=80=94that=E2=80=99s an agent. The context that this folder gives an AI=
 model makes the generalized model a specialist in whatever task or field y=
ou want it to excel in. </p>
<p>I=E2=80=99m running 44 of these folders-as-agents across multiple projec=
ts now. Each one runs inside a specialized folder I=E2=80=99ve built and te=
sted over months, and a dispatch layer I built on top does the routing betw=
een them. Here=E2=80=99s how it works.  </p>  <div class=3D"ea-block normal=
