YXJrbGUtaW4tMTQtZGF5cy13aXRoLWFpIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjM1fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopen=
er noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">vibe code</a></u>=E2=80=94you need <u><a h=
ref=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce=
687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIEZvbGRlciBJcyB0aGUgQWdlbnQg=
IiwicG9zdF9pZCI6NDEwOCwicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vZXZlcnk=
udG8vc291cmNlLWNvZGUvc3RvcC1jb2RpbmctYW5kLXN0YXJ0LXBsYW5uaW5nIiwicG9zaXRpb2=
4iOjM2fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">plans before =
you start building</a></u>=E2=80=94and you can=E2=80=99t <u><a href=3D"http=
s://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebe=
fcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIEZvbGRlciBJcyB0aGUgQWdlbnQgIiwicG9zdF9=
pZCI6NDEwOCwicG9zdF90eXBlIjoicG9zdCIsInVybCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vZXZlcnkudG8vY2hhaW=
4tb2YtdGhvdWdodC93aGVuLXlvdXItdmliZS1jb2RlZC1hcHAtZ29lcy12aXJhbC1hbmQtdGhlb=
i1nb2VzLWRvd24iLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6Mzd9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"=
_blank">vibe fix</a></u> when things break in production, you can=E2=80=99t=
 hand a folder to the dispatch layer and hope for the best. When I start a =
new project, I don=E2=80=99t immediately hand it to the dispatch layer. I s=
et up the folder, build the agent, establish the flows=E2=80=94the <u><a hr=
ef=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce6=
87adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIEZvbGRlciBJcyB0aGUgQWdlbnQgI=
