  <div class=3D"post-body">
    <h2 id=3D"inside-every">Inside Every</h2>
<p>Working with AI right now often means making the same judgment call doze=
ns of times a day: Hand this task off to an agent or stay close to the proc=
ess? =E2=80=9CThe landscape of working with AI is bifurcating,=E2=80=9D is =
how CEO <strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60=
f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIERhd=
24gb2YgQ29kZXgtbmF0aXZlIEFwcHMiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MTU0LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0=
IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9AZGFuc2hpcHBlciIsInBvc2l0aW9uIjo1fQ=3D=
=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Dan Shipper</a></u></str=
ong> put it in Every=E2=80=99s Monday standup. On one side is the agent you=
 delegate to. On the other is the agent that sits beside you while you writ=
e, code, triage, revise, and decide.</p>
<p>Watching the Every team work, you can=E2=80=99t unsee it. Dan delegates =
bug reports for our collaborative document editor, <strong><u><a href=3D"ht=
tps://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5e=
befcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIERhd24gb2YgQ29kZXgtbmF0aXZlIEFwcHMiL=
CJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MTU0LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cDovL3Byb29mZWRp=
dG9yLmFpIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjZ9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank"=
>Proof</a></u></strong>, to his OpenClaw agent, R2-C2<strong>. </strong>But=
 he stays close to his inbox through a combination of <u><a href=3D"https:/=
/every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc=
02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIERhd24gb2YgQ29kZXgtbmF0aXZlIEFwcHMiLCJwb3=
N0X2lkIjo0MTU0LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9jb=
250ZXh0LXdpbmRvdy9vbmUtYXBwLXRvLXJ1bGUtYWxsLWtub3dsZWRnZS13b3JrIiwicG9zaXRp=
b24iOjd9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">Codex</a></u><a hre=
f=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce68=
7adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIERhd24gb2YgQ29kZXgtbmF0aXZlIE=
FwcHMiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MTU0LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ld=
mVyeS50by9Aa2llcmFuXzEzNTUiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6OH0=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferr=
er" target=3D"_blank">,</a> Every=E2=80=99s AI email assistant <strong><u><=
a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619ea=
fce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIERhd24gb2YgQ29kZXgtbmF0a=
XZlIEFwcHMiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MTU0LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cDov=
L2NvcmEuY29tcHV0ZXIiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6OX0=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" tar=
get=3D"_blank">Cora</a></u></strong><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/clic=
k/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJq=
ZWN0IjoiVGhlIERhd24gb2YgQ29kZXgtbmF0aXZlIEFwcHMiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MTU0LCJwb3N=
0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9Aa2llcmFuXzEzNTUiLCJwb3=
NpdGlvbiI6MTB9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">, and a docum=
ent with custom rules (steal his workflow below</a>). <strong><u><a href=3D=
"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adc=
e5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIERhd24gb2YgQ29kZXgtbmF0aXZlIEFwcH=
MiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MTU0LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVye=
S50by9Aa2llcmFuXzEzNTUiLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MTF9" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" ta=
rget=3D"_blank">Kieran Klaassen</a></u></strong> hands the middle of his <u=
><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619=
eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIERhd24gb2YgQ29kZXgtbmF=
0aXZlIEFwcHMiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MTU0LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cH=
M6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9ndWlkZXMvY29tcG91bmQtZW5naW5lZXJpbmciLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6MTJ9"=
 rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">compound engineering</a></u>=
 workflow to the model but works closely with it to brainstorm at the begin=
ning and polish at the end. I (<strong><u><a href=3D"https://every.to/email=
s/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/ey=
JzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIERhd24gb2YgQ29kZXgtbmF0aXZlIEFwcHMiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MTU0L=
CJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9Aa2F0aWUucGFycm90=
dDEyIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjEzfQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_bl=
ank">Katie Parrott</a></u></strong>) send the model off to do research, but=
 I=E2=80=99d never trust it to execute a full draft without my hands firmly=
 on the wheel.</p>
<p>Which means the <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emails/click/7c3f95455f05=
e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/eyJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIE=
Rhd24gb2YgQ29kZXgtbmF0aXZlIEFwcHMiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MTU0LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb=
3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9ldmVyeS50by9jaGFpbi1vZi10aG91Z2h0L3RoZS1rbm93bGVk=
Z2UtZWNvbm9teS1pcy1vdmVyLXdlbGNvbWUtdG8tdGhlLWFsbG9jYXRpb24tZWNvbm9teSIsInB=
vc2l0aW9uIjoxNH0=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">allocati=
on economy</a></u> thesis was only right about half the work. Some of it st=
ill wants delegation, but the other half wants you to stay close, pairing o=
n every move with the model in the same window. The two halves demand diffe=
rent skills, and the meta-skill is knowing which is which.</p>
<p>Think of it as the AI version of the <u><a href=3D"https://every.to/emai=
ls/click/7c3f95455f05e60f87698e654f454c619eafce687adce5ebefcc02e18966e242/e=
yJzdWJqZWN0IjoiVGhlIERhd24gb2YgQ29kZXgtbmF0aXZlIEFwcHMiLCJwb3N0X2lkIjo0MTU0=
LCJwb3N0X3R5cGUiOiJwb3N0IiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9lbi53aWtpcGVkaWEub3JnL3dpa2k=
vU2VyZW5pdHlfUHJheWVyIiwicG9zaXRpb24iOjE1fQ=3D=3D" rel=3D"noopener noreferr=
er" target=3D"_blank">serenity prayer</a></u>: Grant me the serenity to del=
egate the work I can, the expertise to sit with the model on the work I can=
=E2=80=99t, and the wisdom to know the difference.</p>
<p><em>Was this newsletter forwarded to you? <u><a href=3D"https://every.to=
